<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Hawaaruntsi Oocha</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hawaarunts Oocha</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hawaaruntsi Oocha</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hawa.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Hawaaruntsi Oocha</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaruntsi oocha maxaafize, Luqasa Wonggele kaallii xaafinttide maxaafe. Maxaafizes yeze aafe qoftta tiino Yesuusa kaallide asuntsi Geeshi Ayyaana kaalitsin, E baz ohize Wonggele qaala, Yerusalaame, Yihuda sa7a ubba, Samaara, sa7a gaxappa gaxa yellodes (1:8) wayzi yeltsezako ohodes. Maxaafize, markkatitsi Ayhude asunts gidda aykkii, kumutsi alamite yeze asunts si7ode wontsis wayzi dalggezako ohize taarike aykkidaya. Hyay maxaafize xaafize, ammanze asuntsi Roome ka7itumo gol7isades giddara zorinttize asi maaqqikaayzannon ammano Ayhuduntsi haymaanote folo oochchiza maaqqizanno erisodes gaama labbii oochchida.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaruntsi oocha maxaafite Yesuusa baz ohize Wonggele yeltsize bessita wodite wodite dalggii dalggii hyammadannon woosa keetstsi eqqidanno beeze hyaydzdzii aafe kifile tagodes dandda7inttane:</para>
  <para style="ip">Ammano Yesuusa Salo kezii maaqqin aykkinttidanno.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ammano Isra7eele sa7a ubba yellidanno.</para>
  <para style="ip">Roome gujjii Meditiraane Abba kale wutii yeze sa7a ubba dalggidanno beezane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaaruntsi oocha maxaafite aadhii benttize Geeshi Ayyaana oocha maaqqadera, Phenxeqosxe wode Yerusalaame yeze ammanzuntsalla wolqqara wodhdhidanno ohine. Yinnii gaara, maxaafize gidda oochinttide oochito ubba benttidannigaara Geeshi Ayyaana woosa keetstsan woosa keetstsa ahizuntsana kaalitsodannon mintsitsodanno gujjii ohine. Hawaaruntsi oocha gidda oochinttide oochito kiittize ammanze asuntsi de7iten woosa keetstsa fettetitsa yeze wolqqa akko gaar damma yezako beezane.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Markkatitsis giigintte <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-26">1:1-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yesuusa wurssutsite inggide kiitan ye7odes yeze Ayyaana inggide ufayssi <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:1-14">1:1-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Yihuda besite Maatiyasa doore <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 1:15-26">1:15-26</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Markkatitsi Yerusalaame <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 2:1-8:3">2:1—8:3</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Markkatitsi Yihudan Samaaran <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 8:4-12:25">8:4—12:25</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Phawuloosa hawaaretitsi oocha <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-28:31">13:1—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Tiino hawaaretitsi qite13:1—14:28</para>
  <para style="io2">Yerusalaame shiiqo <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 15:1-35">15:1-35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Lam7intsa hawaaretitsi qite15:36—18:22</para>
  <para style="io2">Hyaydzdzintsa hawaaretitsi qite18:23—21:16</para>
  <para style="io2">Phawuloosa Yerusalaame, Qisaariyan Roomen acintte <char style="ior"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28:31">21:17—28:31</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1-2"/>Tewofiloosa, Yesuusa fa oochito aykkide wodeppa salo qitode wode yellodes, oochchidannon tamaarssidannon ubba taanii ta tiino maxaafite xaafida. Salo kessadannippa tiino E fa dooride hawaaruntsana Geeshi Ayyaanara kiittida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">Luqa. 1:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:1-2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3"/>E fa madhitip suuba hyayqoppa denddidanno de7o maaqqii unttis fana beezida. Oyttam qamma unttis benttii Xoozze ka7itumo unttana tamaarssida. <verse eid="ACT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4"/>Fettii ode unttara wolla mu7itera unttana hyannigaar ga7i kiittida: «Ta yinttis ohide, ta Aday inggoda gayde ufays qaaltto naagotep attin Yerusalaameppa kezippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Luqa. 24:49</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5"/>Akkos gayko, Wahannisa hyaatsara xammaqida, yezin eerats wodeppa suuba Geeshi Ayyaanara yin xammaqinttoda» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Maato. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:8">Mar. 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luqa. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:33">Waha. 1:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesuusa salo qite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6"/>Unttin wolla shiiqide wode, «Laatstso, Isra7eeluntsis ka7itumtto ne mahode wodita hyanno?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7"/>Yesuusa unttago, «Ta Aday fa adetits wolqqite oochchize woditon beriton yin erodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="ACT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8"/>Yezin Geeshi Ayyaana yinttalla wodhdhide wode yin wolqqa ekkoda. Yeyizi maaqqii, Yerusalaame, Yihuda sa7a ubba, Samaaran sa7a gaxa yellodes yin taas markka maaqqada» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Maato. 28:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:15">Mar. 16:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:47-48">Luqa. 24:47-48</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9"/>Yinno gaydannip maaqqii un be7izin, dhoqi dhoqi ga7i, salo kezin dhonne eza un aafittippa geentsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mar. 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-51">Luqa. 24:50-51</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10"/>Yesuusa qitodera un salo mahi be7adera, bootsi ma7o ma77ide lam77i asuntsi tiirikaayzin un kale eqqii, <verse eid="ACT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11"/>«Galila asuntso, salo bi7itera, yin akkos eqqidote? Hyay yin be7izin salo qitide Yesuusa yinnii fana maaqqii ye7oda» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yihuda besite Maatiyasa doorinttida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Maato. 27:3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, hawaaruntsi Shamahe Derizeppa Yerusalaame maaqqida. Shamahe Derize Yerusalaames fettii kilo metire fana yene. <verse eid="ACT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13"/>Un Yerusalaame gelii, fa yeze fooqe keetsitilla kezida. Unttin: Phexiroosa, Wahannisa, Yayqooba, Inddirase, Filphoosa, Toomaasa, Bartolomiyoosa, Maatoosa, Ilfiyoosa na7a Yayqooba, fa sa7itis yiqsinttize Simoonara Yayqooba na7a Yihuda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Maato. 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar. 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luqa. 6:14-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14"/>Hyantses ubbuntsi maachuntsara, Yesuusa intta Mayramiran Yesuusa ishuntsaran ubba fettii wozina maaqqii mintsii woossane.<verse eid="ACT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15"/>Ye wode Phexiroosa xeeti lam7itam maaqqade ammanze asuntsi shiiqide besite denddii eqqii, hyannigaar gayda: <verse eid="ACT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16"/>«Asuntso, Yesuusa aykkiduntsana kaalitside Yihudabaz Geeshi Ayyaana tiino Dawute doontte ohide Xoozze qaaltta folinttodes beezane. <verse eid="ACT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17"/>Yihuda nuura wolla hyanna oochito oochchodes doorinttide asi.»<verse eid="ACT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18"/>Yezin Yihuda fa gene oochitira denggide miishera gade wonggida. E tiinor guphunttii gol7in, E sazita feedhinttida; E merqita wul7inttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Maato. 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16-19">Mar. 3:16-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:14-16">Luqa. 6:14-16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19"/>Yihudalla afa hyanidanno Yerusalaame yeze as ubbuntsi si7ida. Yinnii gisho, yinna sa7ito fa doonara Akelddaama (Suuts gade) ga7i xeegida.<verse eid="ACT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20"/>«Yinnan mazmure maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 1:20">«E keetsita hyarii atto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">ooden ize yezippe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 1:20">Mahi ‹E shuumatitsito melle ekko› ga7intti xaafinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Maz. 69:25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21"/>«Yinnii gisho, Laatstse Yesuusa nu gidda wutii hyanttide wode ubba nuura yezuntsappa, <verse eid="ACT 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22"/>mahi Xammaqize Wahannisa woditippa aykkii Laatstse Yesuusa salo kezide wode yellodes nuura yezuntsappa fettii asi E dendditis nuura markka maaqqades beezane» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Maato. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mar. 1:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luqa. 3:21</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23"/>Yinnii gisho, asuntsi dooritis Yosxoosa gaaze Barssabaasa ga7inttize Yoosefan Maatiyasa lam77untsana shiishida. <verse eid="ACT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24"/>Yinnippa suuba, Xooz woossittera, «As ubba wozina erize Laatstso, hyantsi lam77untsappa ne oona doorezako nuna beezo. <verse eid="ACT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25"/>Yihuda fa bessa qitii, ashshide oochchite hawaaretitsi oocha ekkode gaar hyantsesappa nuus shago» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26"/>Unttis ixa olida. Ixitan Maatiyasas wodhdhin Maatiyasa taphpho fettii hawaaruntsalla gujinttida.<verse eid="ACT 1:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Geeshi Ayyaana wodhdhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1"/>Phenxeqosxe gaaze qamma yellide wode ammanzunts ubba wolla fettii bessa shiiqii yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Leewe 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Mahe 16:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2"/>Qoppikaayzin damma tookkii ekkii qitode fana yeze baqo guumii saloppa yi7i un yeze keetsite kumida. <verse eid="ACT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3"/>Mahi tama loxe fana aazize lissanuntsi unttis benttida, shaakkintti shaakkintti un ubbuntsalla bettida. <verse eid="ACT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4"/>Un ubbuntsi Geeshi Ayyaanara kumii dumma dumma doonara ohinttode fana Geeshi Ayyaana unttis ohode fana inggidannigaar ohe aykkida.<verse eid="ACT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5"/>Ye wode saloppa oomora yeze sa7a ubbappa yi7ide Xooz zhashtize Ayhuduntsi Yerusalaame yene. <verse eid="ACT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6"/>Yinna ootsito si7ide wode gaama asi shiiqida. Ammanze asuntsi un fa doonara ohinttodera si7ide gisho <verse eid="ACT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7"/>gawude baz dhabin gaama qoppii, «Hyantsi ohinttize asuntsi ubba Galila as baane? <verse eid="ACT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8"/>Yeezin, nuunii, nu yelinttide gade doonar un ohinttodera wayzi si7odes dandda7ido? <verse eid="ACT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9"/>Nuunii Phartte, Meedona, Elaamen, Mesphexomiya, Yihuda gidda, Qaphadooqiya, Phanxoosa, Isiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10"/>Phirgge, Phinfile, Gibxxe, Qaarena kale yeze Liibiya worada yezuntsana. Nuuppa bagguntsi Roomeppa yi7ide asi. <verse eid="ACT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11"/>Ayhuduntsin Ayhuduntsi ammano gelide asuntsi, Qarxeesan Arabe asuntsi, Xoozii oochchide damma oochito nu doonar ohinttodera nu si7ine» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12"/>Ubbuntsi gaama qoppii, ga7odebaz dhabin woligo, «Yii7i hyanno akko gawude?» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13"/>Yezin melluntsi, «Hyantses kaxxikaayze woyne uzhii matsinttida» yaga7i leqqida.<verse eid="ACT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa ohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14"/>Yezin Phexiroosa, taphpho fettii hawaaruntsara denddii eqqii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, unttago hyannigaara yaga7i ohida: Ayhuduntso, Yerusalaame yeze ubbuntso, ta ohizanno si7ote. <verse eid="ACT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15"/>Wonttappa hyaydzdzii saate maaqqide gisho yin qoppizannigaara hyantsi asuntsi matsinttikaaya; yinna yin achcha erinttidebaz maaqqo. <verse eid="ACT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16"/>Yezin hyanna hyanidanna nabe Iyu7eella ohidanna folinttode fana.<verse eid="ACT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17"/>« ‹Xoozii, wode wurssutsite hyannigaara hyanoda yagaane:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">taanii as ubballa ta Ayyaana gussoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Yin dhiiratsi na7untsin maachi na7untsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">tinbbite ohoda.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">Yin yidhdhuntsi qonccitsi be7ada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:17">yin cimuntsi abukko abukkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Iyu. 2:28-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18"/>Yinna wodite tana ammanze dhiiratsi aruntsallan maachi aruntsalla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">ta ta Ayyaantto gussoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:18">un tinbbite ohoda.<verse eid="ACT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19"/>Mahi taanii afa salo kille baz,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">yeekka sa7a malla beessada.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:19">Suutsi, taman damma cuga qayqayo benttoda.<verse eid="ACT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20"/>Damman bonchcho maaqqide Laatstse wode,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">yellodannippa tiino awa dhumoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:20">aginan suutsi fana yi7ada.<verse eid="ACT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21"/>Yinna wodite hyannigaara yi7oda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:21">Laatstse suntsito xeegize ooden attoda› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22"/>«Isra7eele asuntso, hyanna qaaltto si7ote. Naazirete Yesuusa oona yezako, Xoozii yin gidda oochchide kille bazin mallan yinttis qonccidanno yin, yin ommite erane. <verse eid="ACT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23"/>Xoozze tiino qofiten E eritii baggara Yesuusa aadhii ingginttida. Yinttin eza higge baayzuntsi kushe masqalalla suxxii wodhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:35">Maato. 27:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:24">Mar. 15:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:33">Luqa. 23:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:18">Waha. 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24"/>Yezin hyayqo eza aykkodes dandda7oosse gisho Xoozii hyayqo wolqqa dhabsi eza dentstsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:5-6">Maato. 28:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:6">Mar. 16:6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:5">Luqa. 24:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25"/>Dawute E baz ohitera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:25">« ‹Taanii tannaame fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Laatstsii ta mizaqite yene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:25">Laatstsa ubba wode ta tiino be7ine.<verse eid="ACT 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26"/>Yinnii gisho, ta wozintta ufayttida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">ta il7antsite ufayssi kumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:26">hyayqqize ta ashita ufayssara yessada.<verse eid="ACT 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27"/>Akkos gayko, ta shemppito si7oole gidda ashshoos.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:27">Mahi ne Geesha wooqas ashshoos.<verse eid="ACT 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28"/>Ne tana de7o oge erisida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:28">Ne taara yezannippa ta ufaysita kumutsi maaqqane›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Maz. 16:8-11</ref></char></note>yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29"/>«Ishuntso, nu aday Dawutebaz ta yinttis geeshi ohoda. Dawute hyayqqii mooginttida; E boozita hyayno yellodes nu kale yene. <verse eid="ACT 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30"/>Dawute nabe maaqqide gisho Xoozii E na7untsappa feta E ka7itumo araatalla bettitsodes ees caaqqide caaqito erane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:11">Maz. 132:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">2 Sam. 7:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31"/>Yinnii gisho, Kiristtoosa denddito tiino bi7i, ‹E shemppita si7oole benttaamannon; E ashita wooqaamanno› ohida.<verse eid="ACT 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32"/>«Xoozii, hyaya Yesuusa hyayqoppa dentsidannis nuunii ubbuntsi markka. <verse eid="ACT 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozze mizaqi zalara eza dhoqi dhoqi yiizii, ees inggoda ga7inttide Geeshi Ayyaan Adeppa ekkii, hyanno yin hyatte be7izannon si7izanno nuulla afa gussida. <verse eid="ACT 2:33"/><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34-35"/>Akkos gayko, Dawute fa ommite salo kezikaaya yezin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34-35">«Laatstsi, ta Laatstsa, ‹Ta ne morkkuntsana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">ne tohita yedhdhize bessi mahode wontsis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34-35">hyanne taappa mizaqi zala betto gayda›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:34-35">yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:34-35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36"/>«Yinnii gisho, hyay yin masqalalla suxxide Yesuusa, Xoozii Laatstsin Kiristtoosa mahidanno Isra7eele as ubbuntsi turip ero» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37"/>Asuntsi Phexiroosa ga7idanno si7eze wode fa wozintte azzanii bochinttii Phexiroosan hyankuntsi hawaaruntsago, «Ishuntso, yeezin nuunii akko oochcho?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38"/>Phexiroosa unttago, «Yin nagartta atto ga7inttode gaar nagarttippa maaqqii, yin fete fete Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsite xammaqinttote. Xoozii inggize Geeshi Ayyaana imo ekkoda. <verse eid="ACT 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39"/>Xoozii inggoda gayde ufays qaala yinttis, yin na7untsisin Laatstsii nu Xoozay faago xeegize hyaako yeze ubbuntsis» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40"/>Phexiroosa unttis melle qaalan gujjii markkidhii, «Hyantsi wobbo asuntsalla yo7odes yeze firddappa yin ommito ashshote» yaga7i zorida. <verse eid="ACT 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41"/>Phexiroosa ohidanno ekkiduntsi xammaqinttida. Ye wode hyaydzdzii mukul maaqqade asuntsi ammanii gujunttida. <verse eid="ACT 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42"/>Un hawaaruntsi timirttera, fettetitsara, wolla katstsa me7eran Xooz woosara miinggi yene.<verse eid="ACT 2:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanze as fettetits de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43"/>Hawaaruntsi kushe gaama kille bazin malla oochinttize gisho asunts ubba zhashtida. <verse eid="ACT 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44"/>Ammanze ubbuntsi fettilla yene; faas yezebaziton ubba fettilla gishinttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">Hawa. 4:32-35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45"/>Un faas yezebazito bayzi birtto fetes fetes koshshide fana gishane. <verse eid="ACT 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46"/>Ubba wode fettii wozinara maaqqii Xoozze Keetstsa shiiqane. Fa keetstsan fete feta xeegii ufayssaran lo77o wozinara katstsa muune. <verse eid="ACT 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47"/>Xoozza galatittera as ubba gidda nashshinttida. Laatstsi attize shemppo qammite qammite unttalla gujjane.<verse eid="ACT 2:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Tohe wobbo atstse faxe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1"/>Fettii ode Phexiroosan Wahannisan Xooz woossodes uddufun saate Xoozze keetstsa hyanggida. <verse eid="ACT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2"/>Yelinttidannippa denddii tohe wobbo maaqqide fettii asi Xoozze keetstsa gelize asappa muxaata woossode fana ubba wode lo77o gaaze Xoozze Keetsitis furtsite tookkii ki7i gaddane. <verse eid="ACT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3"/>Ye atstse Phexiroosan Wahannisan Xoozze keetstsite gelodes ye7odera bi7i unttana muxaata woossida.<verse eid="ACT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4"/>Unttin eza dakkii bi7i, Phexiroosa «Nuna hyankka bo7o» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5"/>Tohe wobbo atstse un akko baz inggoda aazin unttana bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6"/>Yezin Phexiroosa eego, «Taas biran worqqan baaya, yezin taas yezanno ta nees inggoda. Naazirete Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsite denddii goden hyankan yedhdho» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, E mizaqi kushito aykkii dentstsida. Ellisii E tohitan qilchitan minggida. <verse eid="ACT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8"/>Atstsay doollii denddii eqqida. Goden hyankan yedhdhe aykkida. Yinnippa maaqqii, yedhdhitera, doolliteran Xooz galatittera unttara wolla Xoozze keetstsa gelida.<verse eid="ACT 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9"/>E yedhdhodera Xooz galatoderan asunts ubba eza bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10"/>Bi7ide ubba muxaata woossodes lo77o gaaze Xoozze Keetstsa furtsite bettide eza maaqqidanno erida; E hyanidanno bi7i gaama qofara kumida.<verse eid="ACT 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Xoozze Keetstsa ohide ohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11"/>Atstsay Phexiroosappan Wahannisappan duuxoos ga7i aykkii yezin asuntsi ubba gaama qoppii, Solomona furtsi gaaze bessa wolla unttago yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12"/>Phexiroosa asuntsana bi7ide wode asuntsago, «Isra7eele asuntso, akkos hyanne gaama qoppete? Woy akkos nuna dakkii be7ete? Nuunii nu wolqqara woy nu Xooz zhashtide gisho hyay atstsa fa toher yedhdhode gaar yiissada yinttis aazane? <verse eid="ACT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13"/>Abrahama, Yisaaqa, Yayqooba Xoozze, nu aduntsi Xoozze, fa na7aya Yesuusa bonchchida. Yezin yin hyayqos aatsii inggidaya Philaaxoosa billodes koyin yin E tiino, ‹Nu eza koyoos› yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:15">Keze 3:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14"/>Yin geeshizan xillizan, ‹Nu eza koyoos› ga7i, shemppo wodhidaya yinttis billode gaar Philaaxoosa woossida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:15-23">Maato. 27:15-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-14">Mar. 15:6-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-23">Luqa. 23:13-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12-15">Waha. 19:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15"/>De7o inggizaya yin wodhida, yezin Xoozii hyayqoppa eza dentstsida. Yinnis nu markka. <verse eid="ACT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16"/>Hyay yin be7izen erize atstse faxii miinggidanna Yesuusa suntsite ammanidanne. Hyay yin ubbunts tiintte eza hyannigaar fatstside E Yesuusa ammanide gisho.<verse eid="ACT 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17"/>«Hyatten ta ishuntso, yinttin yinttana kaalitsizunts gaar, erikaayzara oochchidanno ta erane. <verse eid="ACT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18"/>Yezin Xoozii zaga nabunts ubbunts doontte, ‹Kiristtoosa madha ekkodes beezane› yagaydanno yi7i folinttode fana oochchida. <verse eid="ACT 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19"/>Yikke, Xoozii yin nagartto atto gawude gaar maarotitsi geloten Laatstsago maaqqote. <verse eid="ACT 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20"/>Laatstse kaleppa mintsitsize wode yinttis ye7ode fana Xoozii eza tiinidhdhii dooride Kiristtoos Yesuusa yinttis dakkoda. <verse eid="ACT 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21"/>Xoozii fa geeshi nabunts doontte zaga ohidanni gaar ubba bazi killidhdhode wode yellodes Yesuusa salo gam7odes beezane. <verse eid="ACT 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22"/>Muse, ‹Laatstse Xoozii tana dentsidanni gaar yin gidda fa yinttis nabe dentstsoda. Yin E gaazanno ubba si7ote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Mahe 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23"/>Ye nabize ohizanno si7oosse atstse ooden as giddappa shaakkintti dhaboda› gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:19">Mahe 18:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24"/>«Mahi Saamu7eelappa aykkii yeze nabunts ubba yinna qammitibaz ohida. <verse eid="ACT 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25"/>Yin nabunts na7untsana; mahi Xoozii Abrahamas, ‹Sa7a yeze as ubba ta ne kochchiti baggar anjjoda› ga7i nu aduntsis gelide caaqo qaala laattode na7untsana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Medho 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26"/>Xoozii yinttana ubba yin iita ogitippa mahi anjjode fana fa na7aya dentsii yinttis tiinii dakkida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosan Wahannisan Ayhude Shanggo tiino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1"/>Phexiroosan Wahannisan asuntsis ohodera kahinunts hyalaquntsi, Xoozze Keetstsito naagizunts hyalaqizen Saduqaawuntsi unttago yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2"/>Un Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddidannon E baggara hyayqoppa denddo yezanno asuntsana tamaarsside gisho kaccida. <verse eid="ACT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3"/>Yinnii gisho, unttana aykkii sa7ita uguride gisho wonttode wontsis achi keetstsa geltsida. <verse eid="ACT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4"/>Yezin qaala si7iduntsappa gaamuntsi ammanida. Ammanide dhiiratsi asunts faydita ichchin mukul yellida.<verse eid="ACT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5"/>Wonttitsiti ode gade ahizunts, cimuntsin, higge asttamaarunts Yerusalaame shiiqida.<figure style="fig" alt="Part of the Sanhedrin council in session" file="LB00284B.TIF" size="span" ref="4:5">Ayhuduntsi ahize wode </figure> <verse eid="ACT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6"/>Yentsi asunts gidda kahinunts hyalaqize Haannan, Qayyaafa, Wahannisa, Iskkinddiroyan kahinunts hyalaqa iginuntsi ubba yene. <verse eid="ACT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7"/>Phexiroosan Wahannisan fa tiintte essi, «Akko wolqqara woy oode suntsite hyanno yin oochchido?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8"/>Ye wode Phexiroosa Geeshi Ayyaanar kumii, «Ahizuntson, cimuntso, <verse eid="ACT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9"/>hyayno hyay tohe wobbo atstses oochinttide lo77o oochchitisin E wayzi faxezako yin nuna qurichchiko, <verse eid="ACT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10"/>masqalalla yin suxxin, Xoozii hyayqoppa dentstside Naazirete Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsite hyay atstse faxii yin tiintte eqqiday yinttisin Isra7eele as ubbuntsis erinttidebaz maaqqe.<verse eid="ACT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11"/>«Yin ‹Keexxizuntsi leqqii ixxide shuchchize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">keetsi mayzenes omman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ubbappa aadhize shuchchi maaqqida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ye shuchchize Yesuusa.›<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12"/>Yinnii gisho, atotitsi E baggarap attin melle oode baggaran yi7ikaaya. Nu E suntsite attode gaar as ubbas Xoozii saloppa oomora inggide melle suntsi baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13"/>Shiiqide asuntsi Phexiroosan Wahannisan qonccizi ohidanno bi7ide wode un tamaarikaayze cer asi maaqqidanno qoppii gaama nashshida; un Yesuusara yezanno erida. <verse eid="ACT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14"/>Mahi faxide atstse Phexiroosaran Wahannisara eqqidanno asuntsi bi7in gawude baz dhabida. <verse eid="ACT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15"/>Yezin Phexiroosan Wahannisan bale kessade gaar yiizii fa gidda, <verse eid="ACT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16"/>«Hyantsi asuntsalla nu akko oochcho? Un kushite oochinttide damma kille baz Yerusalaame yeze ubbuntsis qonccida. Nu yinno aachchodes dandda7oos. <verse eid="ACT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17"/>Yezin hyanna ohita as gidda dalggaame gaar yikkeppa hyantsi asuntsi Yesuusa suntsite mulon ohaame fanan tamaarssaame fana kayoda» ga7i zorinttida.<verse eid="ACT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18"/>Unttana xeegii, Yesuusa suntsite yikkeppa ohaame gaar woy tamaarssaame gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19"/>Yezin Phexiroosan Wahannisan unttago mahi, «Xoozzes kiitinttodanippan yinttis kiitinttodannippa Xoozze tiino aanna lo77o yezako ane yin firddote. <verse eid="ACT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20"/>Nu bi7idannon si7idannon ohikaayzara si7i gawudes dandda7oos» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21"/>Cimuntsin worzha ahizuntsii tiinostippa miintsi kaccii unttana dakkii ashshida. Asuntsi hyanidannis Xooz galatii bonchchide gisho unttana firddodes dandda7ikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22"/>Yinna kille oochite hyarggitippa faxide atstses laytsita oytamappa aadhane.<verse eid="ACT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanze as woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23"/>Phexiroosan Wahannisa billinttii ammanze bagguntsago hyanggi, kahinunts hyalaquntsin cimuntsi faago gaydebaz ubba unttis ohida. <verse eid="ACT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24"/>Un yinno si7ide wode fettii wozina maaqqii Xoozza hyannigaara yaga7i woossida: «Ubba Ahize Laatstsayo, salo, sa7a, abban un gidda yezanno ubba medhdhidayo,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Keze 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Nah. 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Maz. 146:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25"/>Neenii ne arize, nu aday Dawute doontte Geeshi Ayyaanara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:25">«Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi akkos zuuzinggido?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">Worzhuntsi akkos cer zorinttido?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25-26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Maz. 2:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26"/>Sa7a kaatuntsin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">worzha ahizuntsi wolla Laatstsellan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">Tizhinttidellan denddida yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27"/>«Turon, Heroodisan Phenxe Philaaxoosa Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsaran Isra7eele asuntsara ne tizhide ne geeshi Na7ay Yesuusalla denddodes hyanna katamtte shiiqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Maato. 27:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1">Luqa. 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">7-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-29">Waha. 18:28-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28"/>Mahi neenii ne wolqqaran ne qofar oochchoda ga7i qoppii bettide baz ubba un folida. <verse eid="ACT 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29"/>Hyatten Laatstso, un manddizanno bo7o; nuunii ne aruntsii ne qaaltto kumutsi wozinar ohode gaar nuus wolqqa inggo. <verse eid="ACT 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30"/>Ne geeshi oochanchchize Yesuusa suntsite hyargginttizuntsana fatstsodes, kille bazin gaama qofize baz oochinttode gaar ne kushito micco» ga7i woossida.<verse eid="ACT 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31"/>Un Xooz woossidannippa suuba un shiiqide bessita en7ida. Un ubbuntsi gidda Geeshi Ayyaana kumin Xoozze qaaltto qonccizi ohida.<verse eid="ACT 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tiino ammanze asuntsi fettetitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32"/>Ammanzuntsi ubbunts qofaran wozinaran fetto maaqqida. Un faas yeze baz ubba ta baz ga7i ohoos. Yezin faas yezanno ubba wolla maadinttane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:44-45">Hawa. 2:44-45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33"/>Hawaaruntsi Laatstse Yesuusa hyayqoppa denddidanno damma wolqqara markkidhane. Xoozii un ubbuntsis damma aadho keehatitsi inggida. <verse eid="ACT 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34"/>Gade maaqqin keetstsi yeze ubba bayzi birtto wolalla gaddane. Yinnii gisho ammanzunts gidda madhidhize fettin baaya. <verse eid="ACT 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35"/>Birtto ki7i hawaaruntsis inggane; yinna birtto fetes fetes koshshide fana shaakkii shaakkii inggane.<verse eid="ACT 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36"/>Qoophiroosa gaaze besite yelinttide Yoosefa gaaze Leewe kochchappa maaqqide fete yene. E suntsito hawaaruntsi Barnnabaasa (Mintsitsize na7a) gayda. <verse eid="ACT 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37"/>Barnnabaasa faas yeze gadito bayzi birtto ki7i hawaaruntsis inggida.<verse eid="ACT 4:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Hananiyan E machchita Saphphiiran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1"/>Fettii Hananiya gaaze atstse fa machchita Saphphiirira gade bayzida. <verse eid="ACT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2"/>Yinna bayzide birtippa fa machchita erizin ashshii, attidanno ki7i hawaaruntsis inggida.<verse eid="ACT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3"/>Yezin Phexiroosa Hananiyago, «Ne Geeshi Ayyaana cimmode gaaran gadito bayzide birtippa shaakkii ashshode gaar Xalahe ne wozintte akkos gelido? <verse eid="ACT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4"/>Neenii bayzodannippa tiino gadize nebaz baane? Mahi ne bayzi maaqqinin miishita nebaz baane? Yeezin, yinnii gaarize baz oochchodes akkos ne wozintte qoppido? Ne Xooz tiino worddidhdhidap attin as tiino worddidhdhikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5"/>Hananiya yinna qaaltto si7ide gaar gol7i hyayqqida; yinno si7ide ubbuntsi damma zhashtida. <verse eid="ACT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6"/>Na7atitsuntsi denddii E ahito ziidhii xaaxii kanggi moogida.<verse eid="ACT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7"/>Hyaydzdzii saateppa suuba Hananiya machchita yinno erikaayzara Phexiroosa yeze besite gelida. <verse eid="ACT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8"/>Phexiroosa iigo, «Yin gadito yinna birtis gammatii bayzidate? Ane taas oho» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Izan, «Yee, yinna birtis gammatii bayzida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9"/>Phexiroosa maachito, «Neeran ne azinzera Laatstse Ayyaana fattanodes akkos zorinttidote? Yikke, ne azinza moogide asuntsi bale yene; nenan un bale kessoda» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10"/>Maachita iira Phexiroosa tohiti kale gol7i hyayqqida; shakanuntsi gelize wode hyayqqidanno denggi bale kessii, I azinze kale kanggi moogida. <verse eid="ACT 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11"/>Kumutsi woosa keetsitan yinno si7ide melle asunts ubba damma zhashtida.<verse eid="ACT 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kille bazin gaama qofize bazin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12"/>Hawaaruntsi gaama qofize bazin kille baz asunts gidda oochchiter yene. Ubbuntsi fettii wozinar Solomone furtstsa shiiqane. <verse eid="ACT 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13"/>Melle asappa fettii asin unttar maadinttodes miinggikaaya, yezin asuntsi unttana bonchchida. <verse eid="ACT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14"/>Ammanze dhiiratsuntsin maachunts faydita tiinostippa gaanggite qitida. <verse eid="ACT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15"/>Yinnii gisho, asuntsi hyargganchchuntsana shanchafaran alggara tookkii Phexiroosa aadhize wode E dashita unttappa fetalla fetalla dashode gaar oge doona kessii gaddane. <verse eid="ACT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16"/>Mahi gaama asuntsi Yerusalaame kale yeze katamappa hyargginttizuntsana tuna ayyaana waayitsize asuntsana ekkii ye7ine; ubbuntsin faxane.<verse eid="ACT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hawaaruntsalla baytsi denddida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17"/>Kahinunts hyalaqizen eera yeze Saduqaawuntsi ubba ixxera kumii hawaaruntsalla denddida. <verse eid="ACT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18"/>Hawaaruntsana aykkii worzha achi keetstsa olida. <verse eid="ACT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19"/>Yezin Laatstsi kiitanchcho qamma achi keetstsa furtsito bugii hawaaruntsana bale kessii, <verse eid="ACT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20"/>«Hyanggi, Xoozze Keetstsa eqqii hyanna kille de7o qaaltto asuntsis ubba ohote» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21"/>Hawaaruntsi yinno si7ide wode wontta gooda Xoozze keetstsa gelii tamaarsse aykkida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Kahinunts hyalaqizen eera yezuntsi yi7i, Isra7eele cimuntsana ubba xeegii shiishii hawaaruntsana fa tiino ko7ode gaar wottaddaruntsana achi keetstsa kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22"/>Yezin wottaddaruntsi achi keetstsite hyanggi hawaaruntsana denggikaaya. Suub maaqqii yi7i asuntsago, <verse eid="ACT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23"/>«Nu hyanggize wode achi keetsiti furtsita mintstsii gorddinttin, naagizuntsi furtsite eqqiduntsana denggida. Yezin nu furtsito bugize wode gidda melle atto yezin fettii asin baaya» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozze Keetstsite wottaddaruntsana kiittize kahinunts hyalaquntsi yinno si7eze wode «Hawaaruntsalla akko hyanido?» ga7i tawida.<verse eid="ACT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25"/>Ye wode fettii asi unttago yi7i, «Yikke, yin accide asuntsi Xoozze Keetstsite eqqii asuntsana tamaarssane» yaga7i unttis ohida. <verse eid="ACT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26"/>Xoozze Keetstsite wottaddaruntsana kiittize fa wottaddaruntsara hyanggi hawaaruntsana ki7ida. Yezin un fana asuntsi shuchchara dhogoda ga7i zhashtide gisho unttana aaddashi ki7ida.<verse eid="ACT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27"/>Un hawaaruntsana ki7i, shiiqide shanggunts tiintte essin kahinunts hyalaqize unttago, <verse eid="ACT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28"/>«Yinttana nuunii ye atstse suntsite tamaarssaame gaar mintstsii kiittikaane? Yikke, yin timirttito Yerusalaame katama ubba yeltstsida. Ye atstse shemppitis nuna galisades koyanene?» yaga7i oocida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Maato. 27:25</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29"/>Phexiroosaran hyankko hawaaruntsara unttis mahite, «Nuunii asis kiitinttodannippa Xoozis kiitinttodes beezane. <verse eid="ACT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30"/>Masqalalla yin suxxii wodhide Yesuusa nu adunts Xoozze hyayqoppa dentsida. <verse eid="ACT 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31"/>Isra7eeluntsi nagarappa maaqqade gaaran un nagartta atto ga7inttode gaar Xoozii Yesuusa ahizayan ashshizaya mahi bonchchora faappa mizaqi zalar bettitsida. <verse eid="ACT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32"/>Yinnis nu markka; mahi Xoozze fana kiitinttizuntsis inggide Geeshi Ayyaanan markka» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33"/>Shiiqide asuntsi yinno si7eze wode damma zhilidhdhii, hawaaruntsana wodhodes qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34"/>Yezin as ubba gidda damma bonchchinttide, higge asttamaare maaqqide, Gamaaliyale gaaze fettii Farisaawuze denddii eqqii hawaaruntsana eerats gode bale kessode gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35"/>Yinnippa suuba, shiiqide asuntsago, «Isra7eele asuntso, hyantsi asuntsalla yin oochchodes qoppide bazitippa naaginttote. <verse eid="ACT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36"/>Akkos gayko, hyannippa tiino Tewodaasa fana, ‹Ta damma› ga7i denddin, oyddii xeet maaqqade asuntsi eera wolla maaqqida. Yezin eza wodhin eza kaallize ubbuntsi laanttin fatstsoosse as maaqqii attida. <verse eid="ACT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37"/>Yinnippa suuba, asuntsi faydinttide wode Galilappa yeze Yihuda denddii gaama asuntsi fana kaallode gaar yiizida, yezin eza wodhin eza kaallize asuntsi ubba lanttida. <verse eid="ACT 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38"/>Hyatten ta yinttis ohine; hyantsi asuntsappa shaginttote; unttana bochchippete. Akkos gayko, hyanna qoftton hyanna oochito asi oochchizebaz maaqqiko dhaboda. <verse eid="ACT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39"/>Yezin hyanna qofttan hyanna oochita Xoozappa yi7idebaz maaqqiko, yin unttana dhabssodes dandda7oos. Turippa yin Xoozara kaccinttitera benttaame fana» yaga7i ohida. Yinnii gisho, shiiqide asuntsi Gamaaliyale zoridanno ekkida.<verse eid="ACT 5:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40"/>Hawaaruntsana hyankka faago xeegii alanggara garafizida. Yinnippa suuba, unttago, «Yesuusa suntsito lam7intsa ohippete» ga7i billii dakkida. <verse eid="ACT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41"/>Yesuusa suntsiti gisho un borintte beezzebaz maaqqidanno erize gisho shanggunts tiinoppa ufayttitera kezida. <verse eid="ACT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42"/>Un ubba wode Xoozze keetstsan as keetstsan Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa maaqqidanno tamaarssen sabbaken ashshikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 5:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Laappun diyaqonaatuntsi doorintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1"/>Ye wode kaallizunts faydita gaanggi gaanggi hyanggodera, Girike doona ohinttize Ayhuduntsi Yihuda gidda yelintti yeze Ayhuduntsalla zuuzinggida. Akkos gayko, Girike doonara ohinttize Ayhuduntsi, «Awaras ingginttize katsite nu azinii baayze maachuntsi qohinttida» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2"/>Taphpho lam77i hawaaruntsi woosa keetstsa as ubba xeegii, «Nu Xoozze qaala ohizanno ashshii katstsa muuzanna nuus beezoos. <verse eid="ACT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3"/>Yikke, ishuntso, lo77o oochara, Geeshi Ayyaanaran cinccatitsara kumide laappun asuntsana yin giddappa doorote; nuunii unttana hyanna oochitis shuumoda. <verse eid="ACT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4"/>Yezin nuunii, ubba wode Xooz woosaran qaala tamaarssera minggoda» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5"/>Hawaaruntsi ohide ohita asuntsana ubba ufayssida. Yinnii gisho, ammanon Geeshi Ayyaana kumide Isxifaanosa, Filphoosa, Phirokoroosa, Niqaarona, Ximoona, Pharmmeenan Ayhude ammano gelii maaqqide Anxookiya Niqolawoosa doorida. <verse eid="ACT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6"/>Unttana hawaaruntsi tiino essin, hawaaruntsi unttalla kushe gaddii Xooz woossida.<verse eid="ACT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7"/>Xoozze qaala dalggitter hyanggida. Yerusalaame yeze ammanzunts faydita loytsii gaanggitter hyanggida; gaama kahinuntsin ammanida.<verse eid="ACT 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isxifaanosa aykintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8"/>Isxifaanosa aadho keehatitsaran wolqqara kumii asunts gidda gaama qofize bazin kille baz oochchane. <verse eid="ACT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9"/>Arotitsappa kezide Ayhude woosa Keetstsa asuntsi Qereenappan Iskkinddiriyappa Kilqiyappan Iisiyappa yi7ide fettii fettii asuntsi denddii Isxifaanosara lallida. <verse eid="ACT 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10"/>Yezin Isxifaanosa ohite yeze cinccatitsiton Ayyaanza un ixxodes dandda7ikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11"/>Yinna wodite un, «Musen Xoozin E cashshadera si7ida» gaaze worddo asuntsana dentsida. <verse eid="ACT 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12"/>Yinnii gaar yiizii asuntsana, cimuntsanan higge asttamaaruntsana eella afa dentsitsida. Isxifaanosa aykkii Shanggo tiino kanggida. <verse eid="ACT 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13"/>Eella afa faydide worddo markkuntsi, «Hyay atstse hyanna Geeshi Keetsiton Muse higgiton mahi mahi cazhane. <verse eid="ACT 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14"/>E, ‹Hyay Naazirete Yesuusa, hyanna Xoozze Keetsito laloda; mahi Muse nuus inggide higgito laammoda› yagaaze worddo markka essida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15"/>Shanggo shiiqite bettide asuntsi ubbanna Isxifaanosa loytsii be7ize wode E sintta kiitanchcho sino maaqqii benttida.<verse eid="ACT 6:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Isxifaanosa ohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1"/>Kahinunts hyalaqize Isxifaanosago, «Hyanna turo?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2"/>Isxifaanosa, «Ta ishuntson, ta aduntso, si7ote! Nu aday Abrahama Kaarane yessades hyammadannippa tiino Masephexoomiya yessadera, bonchcho Xoozze ees qonccii,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Medho 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3"/>‹Ne gaditippan ne iginuntsappa shaakkintti ta nena beezze sa7a qito› yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4"/>Ye wode Abrahama Kalddaawyane gadeppa kezii Kaarane sa7a yezida. E aday hyayqqidannippa suuba Xoozii eza hyanna sa7ite hyatte yin yezanne ki7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Medho 11:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:4">12:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5"/>E hyanna gaditippa melle atto yezin toher yedhdhize bessin Abrahamas inggikaaya. Yezin na7a eesi baayze wode Xoozii hyanna sa7ite eesin E kochchitis laattode bessi mahi inggodanno qaala gelida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Medho 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 13:15">13:15</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15:18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6"/>Xoozii Abrahamago, ‹Ne kochchita melle sa7a zaqqotitsa yessada; ize oyddii xeet bere un aro maaqqii aqode fanan un7inttode fana ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Medho 15:13-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7"/>Yezin ta ne kochchito ahize worzhuntsalla firddoda. Yinnippa maaqqii, un yinna gaditippa kezii hyanne taas goynoda› gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Keze 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8"/>Xoozii Abrahama kochchita garrazinttode gaar eera caaqin, Yisaaqa yelinttide osfuntsa qammite garrazinttida. Yisaaqa Yayqooba yelida; mahi Yayqooba taphpho lam77i fa na7untsana, zartii ade maaqqiduntsana garrazida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-14">Medho 17:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2-4">21:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 25:26">25:26</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 29:31-35">29:31-35</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9"/>«Yayqooba na7untsi Yoosefa ixxii Gibxxe gade arotetsis bayzida, yezin Xoozze eera yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:11">Medho 37:11</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:2">39:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:21">21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10"/>Eza, E madhiti ubbappa kessida. Gibxxe kaat Faroona tiino saban cinccatitsin eesi inggida. Gibxxe kaati Yoosefas Gibxxe sa7an fa keetstsito ubba ahode fana adetitsi wolqqa inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:39-41">Medho 41:39-41</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11"/>«Gibxxen Kanaane sa7a ubba naye gelii gaama asi waytsida. Ye wode nu aday Yayqooba na7untsi katstsa denggodes dandda7ikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 42:1-2">Medho 42:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12"/>Yayqooba Gibxxe sa7a katstsa yezanno si7i nu aduntsana tiino yeyga dakkida. <verse eid="ACT 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13"/>Lam7intsa hyanggite Yoosefa fa ishuntsis fana erisida. Gibxxe kaatizen Yoosefa kochchito erida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1">Medho 45:1</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 16">16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14"/>Yoosefa fa aday Yayqoobaran fa kara asuntsana, laappun tam ichchin asuntsana faago ye7ode gaar dakkii ki7izida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-10">Medho 45:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:17-18">17-18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15"/>Yayqooba Gibxxe sa7a wodhdhida; ezin E na7untsi ize hyayqqida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Medho 46:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:33">49:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16"/>Un ahita yinna bessitippa Seekeme tookkintti hyanggi, ize Abrahama Emoore na7untsappa gaama birara wonggide boozite mooginttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:3-16">Medho 23:3-16</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33:19</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 50:7-13">50:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Iya. 24:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17"/>«Yezin Xoozii Abrahamas inggoda gaydanno folize wodita yellodes ukkide wode Gibxxe sa7a yeze nu asuntsi gaanggi gaanggi hyanggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7-8">Keze 1:7-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18"/>Yinnippa suuba, Yoosefa eroosse melle kaati Gibxxe sa7a ka7itida. <verse eid="ACT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19"/>Ye kaatize nu kochchito genii eerats na7untsi hyayqqode fanan unttana bale kessii olode fana nu aduntsana un7itsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:10-11">Keze 1:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 22">22</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20"/>«Yinna wodite Muse yelinttida; E Xoozze tiino gaama lo77o bishshar yeze na7a. Fa aday keetstsa hyaydzdzii agina yellodes diccida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Keze 2:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21"/>Muse kanggi hyaatsi gaxa gaddide wode Gibxxe kaat naata denggi ekkii faas na7a mahi eza dichchida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Keze 2:3-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22"/>Muse Gibxxuntsi eratitsi ubba tamaarii oheran oocharan mintsii as maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23"/>«Muses laytsita oyttam kumide wode fa ishuntsana, Isra7eeluntsana be7ades fa wozintte qoppida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Keze 2:11-15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24"/>Isra7eeluntsappa feta Gibxxe atstse qohodera bi7i ye Isra7eele atstsa maaddii, ye qohiza Gibxxe atstsa wodhii kushe mahida. <verse eid="ACT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25"/>Muse fa ishuntsana fa baggara Xoozii ashshodes yiizanno un tiiroda gayda, yezin un tiirikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26"/>«Wonttistti wode lam77i Isra7eele asuntsi fete fetera hyadhinttodera denggi unttana giigissades koyi, ‹Asuntso, yin wolis ishe; akkosi fete feta qohe?› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27"/>«Yezin fa laggiza qohize Musego, ‹Nena nuulla ahize asin daynna mahide oode? <verse eid="ACT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28"/>Ne omatse Gibxxe atstsa wodhidannigaara tana wodhodes koyane?› yaga7i Muse urqqii dakkida. <verse eid="ACT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29"/>Muse yinno si7ide wode Gibxxeppa bettii Miidiyaame sa7a bete asi maaqqii yezitera lam77i dhiiratsi na7untsana yelida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">Keze 18:3-4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30"/>«Laatstse kiitanchcho oyttam bereppa suuba Siina dere kale yeze akko baayze ganasa zhil7o kube gidda eexize tama loxe gidda Muses benttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30-34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Keze 3:1-10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31"/>Muse fa bi7idanne gaama qoppii, loytsii be7ades zhil7o kube kale shiiqii yezin, Laatstse qaala, <verse eid="ACT 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32"/>‹Taanii ne aduntsi, Abrahama Xooz, Yisaaqa Xooz, Yayqooba Xooz› yaga7itera Musego yi7ida. Muse zhashimora goqii be7ades dandda7ikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33"/>«Laatstsi Musego, ‹Neenii eqqide sa7ita geeshi maaqqide gisho ne tohite yeze caammito kesso. <verse eid="ACT 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34"/>Taanii Gibxxe yeze ta asunts madharan firddara un7inttizanno bi7ida. Un uuftto si7i unttana ashshodes wodhdhida. Hyatte hyayga! Ta nena Gibxxe kiittoda› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35"/>«Isra7eeluntsi hyaya Muse, ‹Nena nuulla hyalaqan daynna mahide oode?› yaga7i ixxidanno hyay atstsa zhil7o kube gidda eesi benttide Kiitanchchuntsi baggara hyalaqan ashshiza mahi Xoozii kiittida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Keze 2:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36"/>Hyay atstse Muse Isra7eeluntsana Gibxxeppa kessii gaama qofize bazin kille baz oochchii unttana Gibxxe sa7a, Erttera Abban, akko baayze ganasa oyttam bere kaalitsida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:5">Keze 7:5</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14:21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Faydo 14:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37"/>«Hyay atstse Isra7eele asuntsago, ‹Xoozii tana dentsidanni fana yin kochchitii giddappa ta gaar nabe yinttis dentsoda› gayday eza Muse.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Mahe 18:15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38"/>Akko baayze ganasa shiiqide Isra7eele asuntsara yeziday, nu aduntsara yeziday Siina Derizella ees ohide kiitanchchuntsara yezide Muse eza. Yeyzi, Xoozze de7o qaala nuus inggodes ekkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:1-20:17">Keze 19:1—20:17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:1-33">Mahe 5:1-33</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39"/>«Yezin nu mayzuntsi Muses kiitinttodes kadhikaaya; eza ixxii suub Gibxxe maaqqades amudhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40"/>Mahi Aaronan, ‹Nuna kaalitsize eequntsana nuus medhdho. Akkos gayko, hyayni nuna Gibxxeppa ki7ide Muse, wayezako nuunii eroos› yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Keze 32:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41"/>Ye wode hyarina aazizi eequntsana medhdhida. Yentsi eequntsis zharsho zharshi fa kushite oochchide oochita un qoftti fana hyanide gisho ufayttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Keze 32:2-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42"/>Yezin Xoozii unttis bantte mahida. Un salo xoolintto goynode gaar unttana olii ashshida. Nabunts maxaafite,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:42">« ‹Isra7eele asuntso, oyttam bere ubba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">akko baayze ganas sa7a shukkide hyarsin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:42">zharshide zharshito taas shiishidaane?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42-43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo. 5:25-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43"/>Yin, yinttis goynodes kesside Moloke dunkkaane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Refaane ga7inttize yin eeqize xoolintto misile tukkida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">Ta yinttana Baabilooneppa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:43">gode dakkoda› ga7intti xaafinttida.<verse eid="ACT 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44"/>«Nu aduntsis akko baayze ganasa markka dunkkaane yene. Ezan Xoozii Muse kiittidannigaaran eza beezidanni gaaran medhdhida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:9">Keze 25:9</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:40">40</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45"/>Mahi nu aduntsi yinna dunkkaantto fa aduntsappa ekkii Xoozii tiino bay7ide Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts gadito aykkide wode Iyyaasura yeyga ekkii gelida. Ye dunkkaaniza Dawute wode yellodes yinna besite yezida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Iya. 3:14-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46"/>Dawute Xoozappa nashshinttida. Mahi Yayqooba Xoozzes yessade keetstsi keexades Xooz woossida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2 Sam. 7:1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1 Zeena 17:1-14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47"/>Yezin eesi keetstsi keexxide Solomona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1 Kat. 6:1-38</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 3:1-17">2 Zeena 3:1-17</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48"/>«Maaqqikon, Ubbappa kattara yeze Xoozze asi keexxide keetstsa yezoos. Nabize gaydanni gaar,<verse eid="ACT 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49"/>« ‹Salo taas araata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">sa7an ta tohita yedhdhize bessi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:49">Yeezin, taas yin akko gaarize keetstsi keexxode?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 7:49">Woy ta shemppize besita aba?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Isa. 66:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50"/>Hyanno ubba ta kushite medhdhika?› yagayda Laatstsi.<verse eid="ACT 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51"/>«Yin wayde si7oosse aso? Yin wozintta Xoozze qaala ekkodes akkosi ixxido? Yin hyayta akkosi tullido? Yin, yin aduntsi gaar ubba wode Geeshi Ayyaana ixxane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 63:10">Isa. 63:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52"/>Nabunts giddappa yin aduntsi bay7ikaayze oode? Xillizay yo7odanno tiinidhii ohiduntsana wodhida. Hyatte yin eza aatsii inggi wodhida. <verse eid="ACT 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53"/>Yin Kiitanchcho kusheppa Xoozze higgito ekkida, yezin kiitinttikaaya» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 7:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isxifaanosa shuchchara dhogintte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54"/>Un yinno si7ide wode fa wozintte Isxifaanosalla gaama zhilidhdhi, fa doontto dha7i manddida. <verse eid="ACT 7:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55"/>Yezin Isxifaanosa Geeshi Ayyaanara kumii, Salo ude bi7i, Xoozze bonchchiton Yesuusa Xoozze mizaqi zalara eqqidanno bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 7:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56"/>«Yikke, taanii salo bugunttin, As Na7ay, Xoozze mizaqi zalara eqqidaya bi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 7:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57"/>Fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii wuysittera, fa hyayito aykkii fettilla eego woxxida <verse eid="ACT 7:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58"/>Eza katamappa gaxa kessii, shuchchara dhogida. Markkuntsi fa ma7ito fettii Saawula gaaze na7atitsi atstse kale gaddida.<verse eid="ACT 7:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59"/>Isxifaanosa, «Ta Laatstso Yesuusa, ta shemppito ekko» yaga7i xeegodera un eza shuchchara dhogane. <verse eid="ACT 7:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60"/>Bunqqunttii, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Ta Laatstsayo, hyanna nagartto unttis atto ga7o» yagayda. Yinno yaga7i maaqqii hyayqqida.<verse eid="ACT 7:60"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Saawula ammanzuntsana bay7ida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1"/>Saawula Isxifaanosa wodhe qofite gelida. Ye wode Yerusalaame yeze woosa keetstsite damma bay7e denddida. Hawaaruntsap attin ammanze ubbuntsi Yihuda sa7an Samaara sa7a lalinttida. <verse eid="ACT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2"/>Fettii fettii Xooz asuntsi Isxifaanosa moogida; mahi ees damma yeekkida. <verse eid="ACT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3"/>Yezin Saawula woosa keetsito lalodes koyane. Ubbunts kara wutii gelii, ammanze dhiiratsuntsanan maachuntsana gochchii kessii achi keetstsa geltsane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">Hawa. 22:4-5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wonggele Samaara sabbakinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4"/>Lalinttide ammanzuntsi qitide bessa ubba qaala ohine. <verse eid="ACT 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5"/>Filphoosa Samaara katama gelii Kiristtoosa baz asuntsis ohida. <verse eid="ACT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6"/>Gaama asuntsi Filphoosa gaydanno si7ide woden E oochchide kille bazito bi7ide woden eza akaakii si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7"/>Tuna ayyaana uukki gaama asuntsappa kezida; mahi gaama tohe gundduntsin wobbuntsin bilinttida. <verse eid="ACT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8"/>Yinna katamite yeze asuntsi damma ufayttida.<verse eid="ACT 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9"/>Yezin Simoona gaaze fettii atstse yinna katamite yene. E, Taanii damma ga7i Samaara asuntsana maridhdhitera gaama qofizittera gam77ida. <verse eid="ACT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10"/>Eeratsappa damma yellodes yeze asuntsana ubba, «Damma Xoozze wolqqita hyanno» ga7i eza si7ine. <verse eid="ACT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11"/>Gaama wodeppa aykkii maridhittera Samaara asuntsana gaama qofize gisho asuntsi eza si7ine. <verse eid="ACT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12"/>Yezin Filphoosa Xoozze ka7itumon Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsitibaz dhiiratsuntsisin maachuntsis ohin, un E baz ammanii xammaqinttida. <verse eid="ACT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13"/>Mahi Simoonan fa ommite ammanii xammaqinttida. Filphoosar wolla hyanggide bessa ubba oochinttize damma kille baz bi7i gaama qoppida.<verse eid="ACT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14"/>Yerusalaame yeze hawaaruntsi Samaara asuntsi Xoozze qaala ekkidanno si7ide wode Phexiroosan Wahannisan unttago dakkida. <verse eid="ACT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15"/>Phexiroosan Wahannisan hyanggi, ammanzuntsi Geeshi Ayyaana ekkode gaar unttis Xooz woossida. <verse eid="ACT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16"/>Akkos gayko, Samaara asuntsi Laatstse Yesuusa suntsite xalaala xammaqinttidap attin unttappa fetellan Geeshi Ayyaana hyaga wodhdhikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17"/>Ye wode Phexiroosan Wahannisan fa kushito unttalla gaddin, un Geeshi Ayyaana ekkida.<verse eid="ACT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18"/>Hawaaruntsi fa kushito unttalla gaddin, unttis Geeshi Ayyaana ingginttidanno Simoona bi7ide wode Phexiroosasin Wahannisas miishe ki7i, <verse eid="ACT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19"/>«Taanin ta kushito gaddize ubbuntsi Geeshi Ayyaana ekkode fana hyanna adetits wolqqito taasin inggoya» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20"/>Yezin Phexiroosa eego, «Ne Xoozze imotitsi miishera ekkodes qoppide gisho ne miishita neera dhabo. <verse eid="ACT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21"/>Ne wozintta Xoozze tiino likke maaqqikaayze gisho nees hyanne gisho woy ixa baaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22"/>Yikke, hyanna ne wozina iitatitsiti gisho nagarttippa maaqqo. Ne wozintte yeze iita qoftto Xoozii atto gawude gaar Laatstsa woosso. <verse eid="ACT 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23"/>Akkos gayko, neenii iita ixxeran nagara achchara yezanno ta be7ine» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24"/>Simoona mahi, «Yin ga7idannippa fettin tana yellaame gaar taas Laatstsa woossote» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25"/>Phexiroosan Wahannisan markkidhidannippan Laatstse qaala ohidannippa suuba Yerusalaame maaqqida. Samaara yeze gaama guta Wonggele ohida.<verse eid="ACT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Filphoosa Tophphe moorinna xammaqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26"/>Laatstse kiitanchcho Filphoosago, «Denddii Yerusalaameppa Gaaza kanggize akko baayze ganasa ogizera hyanggo. Yinna ogita yeekka zalara yene» gayda.<figure style="fig" alt="Philip with the Ethiopian eunuch" file="LB00331B.TIF" size="span" ref="8:26">Filphoosan Tophphe kaatito Hinddekon </figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27"/>Filphoosa denddii qitida. Hinddeko gaaze Tophphe kaattis I miishito ubba naagize Tophphe asi yene. Ezin goynodes Yerusalaame yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28"/>Fara gaarella bettii, Yerusalaameppa fa sa7a maaqqitera nabe Isayaasa maxaafe nabbabane.<verse eid="ACT 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29"/>Geeshi Ayyaana Filphoosago, «Ye gaarizego hyanggi E kale shiiqo» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30"/>Yeezin Filphoosa woxxii hyanggi yellize wode moorinnize nabe Isayaasa maxaafeppa nabbabodera si7i, «Ne nabbabizanna nees gelane?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31"/>Moorinnize «Taas ohi geltsize as baayzin wayzi gelode?» yagayda. Fara gaarzella kezii bettode fana Filphoosa woossida. <verse eid="ACT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32"/>Moorinnize nabbabize maxaafe kifilize,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32-33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 53:7-8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">8:37 Faydo 37 gidda yeze qoftto zaga Grike maxaafuntsi gujjikaaya.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">«E duro fana shukinttodes izhinttida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">Duro na7a fa isintsito meedizunts tiino si77i gaazanni fana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:32">ezin fa doontto bugikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33"/>E toochinttida; ees xillo firdda dhabida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">E de7ita hyanna sa7itippa hyal7ide gisho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 8:33">E yeletuntsappa oonii ohode?» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34"/>Moorinnize mahi Filphoosago, «Nabize obaz ohe? Fa baz ohinen woy melle asi baz ohine? Taas ohoya» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35"/>Filphoosa mahi, Xoozze qaala yinna besstippa aykkii, Yesuusa baz ohize Wonggele ees ohida.<verse eid="ACT 8:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36"/>Un hyanggiter hyaatsi yeze bessa yellida. Moorinnize, «Hyaatsi hyanno bo7o; ta xammaqinttaame fana akko kayze?» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37"/>Filphoosa eego, «Neenii ne kumutsi wozinappa ammaniko dandda7ane» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:37">E mahi, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa Xoozze Na7a maaqqidanno ta ammanane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38"/>Gaarize eqqode fana moorinnize kiittin, lam77untsi wodhdhii hyaatstsa gelida; Filphoosan eza xammaqida. <verse eid="ACT 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39"/>Un hyaatsitippa gaxa kezide wode Laatstse Ayyaana Filphoosa qoppikaayzin ekkida. Lam7intsa moorinnize Filphoosa bi7ikaaya, yezin fa ogito ufayttiter qitida. <verse eid="ACT 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40"/>Filphoosa Azaaxone benttida. Mahi Qisaariya ye7ode wontsis katamar wutii Wonggele markkidhida.<verse eid="ACT 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Saawula Kiristtoosa ammanida</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Hawa. 22:6-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1"/>Ye wode Saawula Laatstsi tamaaruntsana wodhodes manddii kahinunts hyalaqizego qitida. <verse eid="ACT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2"/>Laatstse ogito kaallize dhiiratsuntsanan maachuntsana denggiko, accitera Yerusalaame ko7odes, Demasqqo yeze Ayhude woosa Keetstsis dabddaabbe xaafinttode gaar eza woossida.<verse eid="ACT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3"/>E hyanggi, Demasqqo katama yellodes ukkodera, qoppikaayzin saloppa damma foo7o E kantte foo7ida. <verse eid="ACT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4"/>E sa7ite gol7in, «Saawula, Saawula, akkos tana bay7e?» gaaze qaala si7ida.<verse eid="ACT 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5"/>Saawula, «Laatstso, ne oode?» yaga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">«Taanii, ne bay7ize Yesuusa» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6"/>Laatstsi eego, «Denddii katama gelo; ne oochchodes koshshize baz ize nees ohoda» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7"/>Saawulara ogito hyanggize asuntsi akkon ohikaayzara eqqii attida. Ootsito si7ine, yezin oona yezakon bi7ikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8"/>Saawula gol7ide bessitippa denddii be7ize wode E aafita dengganxida. Yinnii gisho, un E kushito aykkii kaalitsi Damasqqo geltsida. <verse eid="ACT 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9"/>Hyaydzdzii qamma yellodes E be7ades dandda7ikaaya; akkon mu7ikaaya; uzhikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10"/>Damasqqo gidda fettii Hananiya gaaze Yesuusa tamaarize yene. Laatstsi qonccitsara, «Hananiya» yaga7i xeegida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Hananiya mahi, «Ta Laatstso, yoo» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11"/>Laatstsii eego, «Denddii moolo ga7inttize ogito hyanggi, Yihuda keetstsa Saawula gaaze Terseseppa ye7eze atstsa koyo; Saawula hyatte woosalla yene. <verse eid="ACT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12"/>Mahi Hananiya gaaze atstse gelii, Saawula lam7intsa be7ade gaar fa kushito eella gaddodera qonccitsara bi7ida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13"/>Hananiya mahi, «Laatstso, Yerusalaame ne geeshi asuntsalla ye atstse akko gaar iita baz oochchezako ta gaama asappa si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14"/>Mahi Damasqqo gidda ne suntsito xeegizuntsana ubba accodes, kahinunts hyalaquntsi ees adetits wolqqa inggidda» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15"/>Yezin Laatstsi eego, «Saawula Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts tiino, kaatuntsi tiinon Isra7eele asunts tiinon, ta suntsito tookkodesin taas oochchodes doorinttide miishe maaqqide gisho ne eego qito. <verse eid="ACT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16"/>Akkos gayko, ta suntsiti gisho E wantsi madha ekkodes koshshizako ta eza beessada» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17"/>Hananiya hyanggi, keetstsa gelii, fa kushito Saawulalla gaddii, «Ta ishe Saawula, ne yi7ize ogite nees benttide E Laatstse Yesuusa, ne be7ade gaaran Geeshi Ayyaanara kumode gaar tana kiittida» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18"/>Ellisii, Saawula afttippa fettii quro fana yeze baz wodhdhin, Saawula lam7intsa bi7ida. Mahi denddii xammaqinttida. <verse eid="ACT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19"/>Katstsa mu7i minggida. Damasqqo gidda yeze tamaarutsara eeratsi qamma gam77ida.<verse eid="ACT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saawula Damasqqo tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20"/>Ellisii Saawula, «Yesuusa Xoozze Na7a» yaga7i Damasqqo gidda yeze Ayhude woosa keetstsa qaala tamaarssida.<verse eid="ACT 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21"/>Yinno si7ize ubbuntsi qoppii, «Hyay Yerusalaame Yesuusa suntsito xeegizuntsana bay7izaya baane? Mahi hyayga yi7idanna unttana accii, kahinunts hyalaquntsi tiino kanggodes baane?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22"/>Yezin Saawula qaala ohera miinggiter hyanggida. Yesuusa, E Kiristtoosa maaqqidanno qonccizi ohide gisho Damasqqo gidda yeze Ayhuduntsi ees mahodebaz dhabida.<verse eid="ACT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23"/>Gaama qammappa maaqqii Ayhuduntsi shiiqii, Saawula wodhodes zorinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2 Qoro. 11:32-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24"/>Yezin Ayhuduntsi fana wodhodes qoppidanno Saawula erida. Un eza wodhodes qamman awaran katama furtsite naagane. <verse eid="ACT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25"/>Mahi E tamaaruntsi eza qamma kanggi, gimbbe gase wulunqqera kessii daachchora ketstsida.<verse eid="ACT 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Saawula Yerusalaame tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26"/>Saawula Yerusalaame yellide wode ammanzuntsara yellinttodes qoppida. Yezin E Kiristtoosa ammanidanna unttis turo aazanxi ixxin ees zhashtida. <verse eid="ACT 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27"/>Yezin Barnnabaasa Saawula hawaaruntsago kanggida. Oge Laatstsi wayzi qonccezakon ohizezako, mahi Saawula Damasqqo gidda Yesuusa suntsite zhashtikaayzara wayzi qaala ohezako unttis geeshi ohida. <verse eid="ACT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28"/>Saawula Yerusalaame wutii Laatstse suntsite zhashtikaayzara qaala ohitera, hawaaruntsara wolla yezida. <verse eid="ACT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29"/>Mahi Saawula Girike doona ohize Ayhuduntsara ohintti lallida. Yezin un eza wodhodes koyda. <verse eid="ACT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30"/>Ammanze asuntsi yinno si7i, Saawula Qisaariya kanggi Terseese dakkida.<verse eid="ACT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31"/>Yihuda, Galilan Samaaran ubba gidda yeze woosa keetsita sarora yezida. Mahi minggida; Laatstsis zhashtiter Geeshi Ayyaana miintsitsodera gaanggitter hyanggida.<verse eid="ACT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa Liidan Iyoophen tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32"/>Phexiroosa sa7a ubba wutii Liida yeze ammanze asuntsago yellida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33"/>Ize osfun bere kumutsi wobbii yiitsa woy7i yeze Eeniya gaaze atstsa denggida. <verse eid="ACT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34"/>Phexiroosa, «Eeniya, Yesuus Kiristtoosa nena fatstsoda; denddii ne yitsito dentso» yagayda. Ezin ellisii denddii eqqida. <verse eid="ACT 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35"/>Liidan Saaronan yeze asuntsi ubba Eeniya bi7i, Laatstsago maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36"/>Iyoophe katama fettii Xaabito gaaze ammanzanna yene. (Xaabito ga7inttizanna gen77e ga7intte) Iza fa yezide wodite ubba lo77o baz oochiteran dahuntsana maaddite yezida. <verse eid="ACT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37"/>Ye wode iza hyargginttii hyayqqin, asuntsi I ahito meeccii, fooqella kessii woytstsida. <verse eid="ACT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38"/>Liida Iyoophes kale. Ammanzuntsi Phexiroosa Liida yezanno si7i, «Woy7a nuugo ellisii yo7o» yagaaze kiita lam77i asara eego kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39"/>Yinnii gisho, Phexiroosa denddii, unttara qitida. Yeyga yellin, fooqella yeze kifilite eza geltsida. Azini baayze maachuntsi Phexiroosa kantte eqqii yeekkitera Dorqqa unttara faxa yezitera oochchide qamistton afultto ubba Phexiroosa beezida. <verse eid="ACT 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40"/>Phexiroosa unttana ubba bale kessii, bunqqunttii Xooz woossida. Mahi ahitigo maaqqii, «Xaabite, denddo» yagayda. Xaabita fa aafto bugii Phexiroosa bi7i, denddii bettida. <verse eid="ACT 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41"/>Phexiroosa izo fa kushite katizii dentsii essida. Yinnippa maaqqii, ammanzuntsanan azinii baayzuntsana xeegii, un tiino shiishida.<verse eid="ACT 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42"/>Hyanna ohita Iyoophe katama ubba yellida. Gaama asuntsi Laatstsa ammanida. <verse eid="ACT 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43"/>Phexiroosa Iyoophe Simoona gaaze qole hyaashize kara gaama wode gam77ida.<verse eid="ACT 9:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosan Qornneliyoosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1"/>Qisaariya, «Xaaliya ola asuntsana» ga7inttize olinttizunts gidda fettii Qornneliyoosa ga7inttize mato hyalaqa yene. <verse eid="ACT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2"/>Qornneliyoosa fa kara asuntsara Xooz goynizen zhashtize asi, dahuntsanan maaddane, mahi ubba wode Xooz woossane. <verse eid="ACT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3"/>Fettii wode uddufun saate kumizin Xooz kiitanchcho eego yi7i, «Qornneliyoosa» ga7i xeegodera E qonccitsara geeshi bi7ida.<verse eid="ACT 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4"/>Qornneliyoosa zhashtii Kiitanchchiza dakkii loytsii bi7i, «Laatstso, yinna akko?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Kiitanchchize mahi, «Ne woositan dahuntsana ne maaddidanna Xoozze tiino qofinttes yellida. <verse eid="ACT 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5"/>Hyatte asuntsana Iyoophe dakkii, Phexiroosa gaaze Simoona ki7izo. <verse eid="ACT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6"/>Phexiroosa abba gaxa qole hyaashize Simoona kara zaqqottetsi bettida» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7"/>Qornneliyoosa faas ohide kiitanchchize qitin, fa aruntsappa lam77untsana Xooz goynize fa kale wottaddaruntsappa feta xeegii, <verse eid="ACT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8"/>unttis ohi Iyoophe kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9"/>Wonttisti wode un hyanggi, Iyoophe katama ukkodera izipun saate gaar yezin Xooz woossodes Phexiroosa fooqella kezida. <verse eid="ACT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10"/>E naydhdhii katstsa maades koyda, yezin katstsa kaxxodera E ayyaanara maaqqii qonccitsi bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11"/>Salo bugunttin, damma afula aazize baz oyddii zalara aykkinttii wodhdhodera E bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12"/>Iza besite oyddii tohera yeze gurdde xootsi, sazara gochinttize medhetitsin salo landda ubba yene. <verse eid="ACT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13"/>Ye wode «Phexiroosa, denddii eqqii shukkii mo7o» gaaze qaala eego yi7ida.<verse eid="ACT 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14"/>Yezin Phexiroosa, «Laatstso, ade! Ta tuna baz mulon mu7i eroos» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15"/>Mahi, «Xoozii geeshidanno ne tuna ga7ippe» gaaze qaala lam7intsa eego yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16"/>Yinnan, hyaydzdzii tohe yi7idannippa maaqqii ye damma afula aazize ellisii ude salo ekinttida.<verse eid="ACT 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17"/>Phexiroosa fa be7eze qonccitsiti bilitsita, «Akko maaqqad yessa?» ga7i fa wozintte qoppodera, Qornneliyoosa kiitteze asuntsi Simoona kara oocii denggi bale eqqida. <verse eid="ACT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18"/>Fa qaaltto un dhoqi yiizii, «Phexiroosa gaaze Simoona zaqqotits yeze hyanne yene?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19"/>Phexiroosa qonccitsara bi7idanno tawodera, Geeshi Ayyaana eego, «Hyaychche, hyaydzdzii asuntsi nena koyane. <verse eid="ACT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20"/>Denddii wodhdho, ta unttana kiitteze gisho so7ikaayzara unttara qito» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21"/>Phexiroosa asuntsago wodhdhii, «Yin koyze tana; akkos yi7idote?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22"/>Un mahi, «Nuna mato hyalaqize Qornneliyoosa kiittida. E xillo, Xooz goynize asin Ayhude asunts gidda ubba gaama bonchchinttide asi. Qornneliyoosa, nena fa kara ki7izii qaala neeppa si7ode fana geeshi kiitanchcho ees ohida» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23"/>Phexiroosa asuntsana kara geltsii mokkida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Wonttisti wode, denddii unttara qitida. Yoophe katama yeze ammanzuntsappa fettii fettii asunts eera wolla qitida. <verse eid="ACT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24"/>Wonttistti wode, Qisaariya yellida. Qornneliyoosa fa iginuntsanan fa kale lagguntsana fettilla xeegii shiishii, Phexiroosa naagane. <verse eid="ACT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25"/>Phexiroosa kara gelodes yi7adera, Qornneliyoosa eera yellintti E tiino gol7i ees goynodes koyda. <verse eid="ACT 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26"/>Yezin Phexiroosa, «Denddo, taanin ta ommite ne gaar asi» yaga7i eza dentstsida.<verse eid="ACT 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27"/>Phexiroosa Qornneliyoosara ohitera kara gelize wode gaama asuntsi shiiqidanno denggida. <verse eid="ACT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28"/>E asuntsago, «Ayhude asi melle worzhara wolla maaqqades woy yellinttodes woga baayzanno yin erane. Yezin taanii ooden tuna woy geeshi ga7aame gaar Xoozii tana beezida. <verse eid="ACT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29"/>Yinnii gisho, yin taago kiittin ixxikaayzara yi7ida. Hyatte tana akkos xeegizezako taas ohote» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30"/>Qornneliyoosa, «Taanii hyayno oyddii qammappa tiino hyannii wode uddufun saate woosa woossodera, foo7ize ma7o ma77ide asi ta tiino eqqida. <verse eid="ACT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31"/>E taago, ‹Qornneliyoosa, Xoozii ne woosito si7ida, neenii dahuntsana maaddidanno qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32"/>Yikke, asi Yoophe kiittii, Simoon Phexiroosa gaazaya xeegizo. E, Simoona gaaze qole hyaashize atstse kara abba gaxa bettida› yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33"/>Yinnii gisho, ta neego ellisii kiittida; ne yi7idanna lo77o. Yikke, Xoozii nena Kiittidebaz ubba si7odes hyatte nu ubbuntsi hyanne Laatstse tiino yene» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa ohe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34"/>Kaallii, Phexiroosa, «Xoozii asis sino bi7i asi asappa shagoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Mahe 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35"/>Yezin asi ubba oona maaqqikon faas zhashtizayan xillo oocha oochchizella Xoozii ufayttizanno ta turo qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36"/>Xoozii, ubbuntsi Laatstsii maaqqide Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggara sarotitsi ohitera hyanna wonggeltto Isra7eele asuntsis kiittezanno yin erane. <verse eid="ACT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37"/>Wahannisa xinqqate baz sabbakide wodeppa aykkii Galilan Yihuda sa7a ubba yellodes hyanidanno yin erane. <verse eid="ACT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38"/>Xoozii Naazirete Yesuusa Geeshi Ayyaanara tizhii wolqqa inggida. Xoozii eera yeze gisho lo77o baz E oochchitera Xalahe kushe aqiduntsana ubba fatstsitera wutida.<verse eid="ACT 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39"/>«Ayhude sa7an Yerusalaame E oochchide ubbabazitis nu markka. Un masqalalla suxxii eza wodhida. <verse eid="ACT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40"/>Yezin Xoozii hyaydzdzintsa wode hyayqoppa eza dentsii asuntsis qonccode gaar yiizida. <verse eid="ACT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41"/>Yinna qonccitsita Xoozii tiino dooride markkuntsis fattin as ubbas maaqqoos. E hyayqoppa denddidannippa maaqqii eera mu7i uzhida. <verse eid="ACT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42"/>Nu Wonggele asuntsis ohode gaaran faxa yezuntsallan hyayqqiduntsalla firddodes Xoozii shuumide Yesuusa maaqqizanno markkidhade gaar nuna kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 10:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43"/>Xoozii eza ammanize ubba nagartta, E suntsite atto ga7inttizanno nabuntsi markkidhane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 10:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi ammanii Geeshi Ayyaana ekkida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44"/>Phexiroosa hyaga yinna ohito hyaasikaayzin qaala si7ize ubbuntsalla Geeshi Ayyaana wodhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 10:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45"/>Phexiroosara Yoopheppa yi7ide ammanize garrazinttide Ayhude ubbuntsallan, Ayhude maaqqoosuntsallan Geeshi Ayyaana wodhdhidanno bi7i gaama qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 10:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46"/>Akkos gayko, un melle melle doonara ohiteran Xoozze dammatitsito sabbodera si7ida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Ye wode Phexiroosa mahi, <verse eid="ACT 10:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47"/>«Hyantses mahi nu gaar Geeshi Ayyaana ekkiduntsi xammaqinttaame gaar hyaatsi kayode oode?» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 10:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48"/>Un Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsite xammaqinttode gaar unttana kiittida. Yinnippa maaqqii, un faara eerats wode bettode gaar Phexiroosa woossida.<verse eid="ACT 10:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Phexiroosa fa oochchidanno Yerusalaame woosa keetstsis ohida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1"/>Hawaaruntsin Yihuda yeze ammanzuntsi, Ayhude maaqqoosuntsin Xoozze qaala ekkidanno si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2"/>Phexiroosa Yerusalaame qitide wode garrazinttide ammanzuntsi, <verse eid="ACT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3"/>eego, «Ne garrazinttikaayzuntsago gelii unttara katstsa akkos mu7ido?» ga7i lallida.<verse eid="ACT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4"/>Yezin Phexiroosa hyanidanno tiinoppa aykkii tarar tarar ohida: <verse eid="ACT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5"/>«Taanii Yoophe katama Xooz woossittera qonccitsi bi7ida. Damma afula aazize baz oyddii zalara aykkinttii saloppa wodhdhitera taago yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6"/>Taanii dakkii loytsii E gidito be7ize wode oyddii tohera yeze gurdde xootsuntsi, sazara gochinttize medhon salo landduntsana bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7"/>‹Phexiroosa, denddii, shukkii mo7o› gaaze qaala si7ida.<verse eid="ACT 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8"/>«Yezin taanii, ‹Laatstso, ade, tuna baz woy geezhikaayzebaz mulon doonago shiishii eroos› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9"/>« ‹Xoozii geeshidanno neenii tuna ga7ippe› yagaaze qaala lam7intsa saloppa yi7ida.<verse eid="ACT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10"/>«Yinna hyaydzdzii tohe hyanidannippa suuba, maaqqii ubba bazita salo ude ekinttida. <verse eid="ACT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11"/>Yinna saate hyaydzdzii asuntsi Qisaariyappa taago kiitinttii ta yeze keetstsite yellida. <verse eid="ACT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12"/>So7ikaayzara unttara qitode gaar Ayyaana taas ohida. Mahi hyanna izippun ishuntsi Yoopheppa taara Qisaariya hyanggiduntsara Qornneliyoosa kara gelida. <verse eid="ACT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13"/>Kiitanchcho E kara eqqii, ‹Yoophe kiittii Phexiroosa ga7inttize Simoona xeegizo. <verse eid="ACT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14"/>Nenan ne kara as ubba ashshize qaala E nees ohoda› gaydanno Qornneliyoosa nuus ohida.<verse eid="ACT 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15"/>«Taanii ohe aykkize wode Geeshi Ayyaana tiino nuulla wodhdhidannigaara unttallan wodhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16"/>Ye wode ‹Wahannisa hyaatsara xammaqida, yezin yin Geeshi Ayyaanara xammaqinttoda› yagayde Laatstse qaaltta taas tiirinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">Hawa. 1:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17"/>Xoozii nuus Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammanzuntsis inggide imotitsito mahi izo Ayhude maaqqoosuntsisin inggiko, yeezin Xooz kayodes ta oode?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18"/>Un yinno si7ide wode fa lallizanno ashshii, «Yinno maaqqiko, Xoozii Ayhude maaqqoosuntsin nagarappa maaqqii de7o yessade gaar ixa inggida» yaga7i Xooz galatida.<verse eid="ACT 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Anxookiya woosa keetstsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19"/>Isxifaanosa hyayqos yeltside bay7e gisho lalinttide ammanzuntsi qaala Ayhudunts xalaalas ohitera Siroofinqe, Qoophiroosan Anxookiyan yellodes wutida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">Hawa. 8:1-4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20"/>Yezin Qoophiroosappan Qereenappan yi7ide fettii fettii ammanize asuntsi Anxookiya hyanggi, Laatstsi Yesuusa Wonggele Girike asuntsis ohida. <verse eid="ACT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21"/>Laatstse wolqqa unttara yene; mahi gaama asuntsi ammanii Laatstsago maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22"/>Yinna ohito Yerusalaame yeze woosa keetsita si7ide gisho Barnnabaasa Anxookiya kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23"/>Barnnabaasa Anxookiya qitide wode Xoozze aadho keehatitsi oocha bi7i ufayttida. Un ubbuntsi fa kumutsi wozintte Laatstse gidda miinggi yessade gaar unttana zorida; <verse eid="ACT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24"/>yinnii gisho Barnnabaasa Geeshi Ayyaanaran ammanora kumide lo77o asi. Gaama asuntsi Laatstsa ammanida.<verse eid="ACT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, Barnnabaasa Saawula koyodes Terseese qitida. <verse eid="ACT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26"/>Ize Saawula denggide wode Anxookiya ekkii yi7ida. Barnnabaasan Saawula woosa keetstsi asuntsara fettii bere mulo bettii gaama asuntsana tamaarssida. Tamaaruntsi Anxookiya woosa keetstsa «Kiristtaane» ga7intti tiinii xeeginttida.<verse eid="ACT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27"/>Ye wode fettii fettii nabuntsi Yerusalaameppa Anxookiya wodhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28"/>Un giddappa Agaboosa ga7inttize denddii sa7a ubba damma naye kessadanno Ayyaana wolqqara tinbbite ohida. Yinna hyanidanna Roome Kaat Qalawudiyoosa wode.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">Hawa. 21:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29"/>Ammanzuntsi fete fete fa wolqqiti gaar miishe kessii Yihuda yeze ammanzutsis maade dakkodes qofa accida. <verse eid="ACT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30"/>Un hyannigaara yeyzi, miishito Barnnabaasaran Saawularan woosa keetstsa cimuntsis dakkida.<verse eid="ACT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keetstsalla damma baytsi yellida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1"/>Ye wode Kaat Heroodisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Kaat Heroodisa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyay Kaat Heroodisa, Heroodisa Agirpha gaazes anggissaya. E, 37-44 Maarotitsi Bere yellodes ahida. E kaat Heroodisas naazes na7a. Ezin hawaaruntsi oocha Zofa. 25 yezes ade.</char></note> woosa keetstsi asuntsappa bagguntsana bay7e aykkida. <verse eid="ACT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2"/>Wahannisa ishe Yayqooba mashshara wodhida. <verse eid="ACT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3"/>Yinna Ayhuduntsana ufayssidanno bi7i, gujjii Phexiroosan aytsida. Yinna hyanidanna boora Ba7ale bonchchize qammite. <verse eid="ACT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4"/>Phexiroosa aykkii accida. Faasiga bonchchize woditippa maaqqii worzhunts tiino aatsodes qoppii, oyddii oyddii wottaddaruntsi eza naagode gaar taphpho izippun wottaddaruntsis aatsii inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Keze 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5"/>Yinnii gisho, Phexiroosa achi keetstsa naaginttane. Yezin woosa keetstsa asuntsi ees mintsii Xooz woossane.<verse eid="ACT 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiitanchcho Phexiroosa achi keetstsappa kessida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6"/>Heroodisa Phexiroosa asunts tiino shiishodannippa tiino qamma Phexiroosa lam77i zalara lam77i wottaddaruntsaran lam77i santsalaatara acinttii un gidda genttida. Naagizuntsi achi keetstsa furtsite eqqii naagane. <verse eid="ACT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7"/>Tiirikaayzin Laatstse kiitanchcho benttida. Achi keetstsa foo7o foo7ida. Kiitanchchize Phexiroosa millito bochchii barkkizii, «Elle denddo» yagayda. Iira santsalaatan E kushtippa wodhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8"/>Kiitanchchize eego, «Ne ma7ito ma77o, ne caammiton aatso» yagayda. Phexiroosa hyannigaara oochchida; kiitanchchize, «Ne laxinza ma77i tana kaallo» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9"/>Phexiroosa achi keetstsappa kezii kiitanchchiza kaallida. Ees qonccitsi be7izegaara yi7idap attin kiitanchchize oochchize bazita turo aazikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10"/>Kiitanchchizen Phexiroosan tiinon lam7intsa naagize zabiza aadhii katama kanggize birita furtsitigo yellida. Furtsita unttis fa faas erii bugunttida. Un kezii fettii ogera hyanggodera kiitanchchize tiirikaayzin Phexiroosappa shaakkinttida.<verse eid="ACT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11"/>Phexiroosas wozintta maaqqin, «Tana Laatstsi fa Kiitanchchiza dakkii, Heroodisa kushtippan naagii bettide Ayhude asunts ubbappa ashshidanno hyatte turo erida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12"/>E yinno akaakide wode gaama asuntsi wolla shiiqii Xooz woossize besite, Marqqoosa gaaze Wahannisa intta Mayrami kara qitida. <verse eid="ACT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13"/>Ize bale eqqii xeegida. Fettii Rooda ga7inttize arita furtsito bugodes yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14"/>Rooda Phexiroosa qaala maaqqidanno eride wode ufayssar kumii bale bugikaayzin suub woxxii hyanggi, «Phexiroosa bale eqqida» yaga7i asuntsis ohida.<verse eid="ACT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15"/>Asuntsi iigo, «Ne zhaashtane!» yagayda. Rooda Phexiroosa maaqqidanno geeshi ohida. Un, «Ye E kiitanchcho» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16"/>Yezin Phexiroosa bale eqqii xeegii ashshanxin asuntsi furtsito bugii eza bi7i gaama qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17"/>Yezin un si77i gawude gaar Phexiroosa fa kushite mallii Laatstsi achi keetstsappa eza wayzi kessezako unttis qonccizi ohi, «Hyanno Yayqoobasin ammanze asuntsis ohote» ga7i izip kezii melle bessa qitida.<verse eid="ACT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18"/>Sa7a wonttize wode «Phexiroosa aba qitido?» ga7i wottaddaruntsi wol gidda gaama kacinttida. <verse eid="ACT 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19"/>Heroodisa Phexiroosa koyzin, E dhabide wode naagizuntsana qurii, unttana wodhode gaar kiittida. Yinnippa suuba, Heroodisa Yihudappa Qisaariya wodhdhii ize eerats wode bettida.<verse eid="ACT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Heroodisa hyayqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20"/>Heroodisa Xiroosa asuntsallan Sidoona asuntsalla gaama kaccida. Un wolla fettilla yi7i kaat moorinna Bilasxoosa maadinttode gaara woossii yee7e ga7izii faas cima mahi giigodes Heroodisago hyanggida. Un gadita katstsa kaatize gadeppa denggane yeshsha.<verse eid="ACT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21"/>Heroodisa shuuminttide wode fa ka7itumo afultto ma77i, araatalla bettii asuntsis ohida. <verse eid="ACT 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22"/>Asuntsi, «Yinna Xoozze qaala, as qaala baaya» yaga7i uukkida. <verse eid="ACT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23"/>Heroodisa Xooz bonchchikaayze gisho iira Laatstse kiitanchcho eza guuddin zaqilara mu7intti hyayqqida.<verse eid="ACT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24"/>Yezin Xoozze qaala dicciteran dalggitera hyanggida.<verse eid="ACT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25"/>Barnnabaasan Sawulan fa oochito faaddii Marqqoosa gaaze Wahannisa faara ekkii Yerusalaamep maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Barnnabaasan Saawulan kiitinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1"/>Anxookiya yeze woosa keetstsa nabuntsin asttamaaruntsin yene. Un Barnnabaasa, Kartsi ga7inttize Simoona, Qereenappa yi7ide Lukiyosa, Kaat Heroodisara diccide Minaahenen Saawulan. <verse eid="ACT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2"/>Un Laatstsi goynoderan xoomodera Geeshi Ayyaana, «Taanii xeegide oochitis Barnnabaasan Sawulan taas shaakkote» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3"/>Yinnii gisho, un xoomidaanippan woossidannippa maaqqii fa kushito unttalla gaddii dakkida.<verse eid="ACT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnnabaasan Saawulan Qoophiroosa qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4"/>Yinnii gisho, Geeshi Ayyaana unttana kiittida. Selewuqe hyanggida; iippa markkabe gidda gelii Qoophiroosa hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a qitida. <verse eid="ACT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5"/>Un Silmmaana yellii Ayhude woosa keetstsa Xoozze qaala ohida. Wahannisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Wahannisa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hyanna besite xaafinttide, hawaare Wahannisa maaqqikaayzin Wahannisa Marqqoosa ga7inttize Marqqoosa Wonggele xaafidaya.</char></note> maadditera unttara yene.<verse eid="ACT 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6"/>Un Qoophiroosa hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a aadhii Phaafu yellize wode fettii worddo nabe Bar-Yesuusa gaaze Ayhude maro denggida. <verse eid="ACT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7"/>Ye marize worzha ahize Sarggiyoosa Phawuloosa gaaze qofara yeze atstsera yene. Sarggiyoosa Phawuloosa Barnnabaasan Sawulan faago xeegii Xoozze qaala si7odes koyda. <verse eid="ACT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8"/>Yezin Girike doonara marizay suntsitan «Elmmaasa» ga7inttane. E gade ahize ammanaame gaar kayodes koyi Barnnabaasan Phawuloosan ixxida.<verse eid="ACT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9"/>Yezin Phawuloosa gaaze Saawula Geeshi Ayyaanara kumii marizaya dakkii bi7i, <verse eid="ACT 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10"/>«Naate, Xalahe na7ayo, iitatitsi ubba kumidayo, xillotitsi ubbas morkkizayo, luule Laatstse ogito mirqqizanno ashshoso? <verse eid="ACT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11"/>Yikke, hyatte Laatstse kushe neella yene. Ne qooqe maaqqada; eerats wodes awa foo7o ba7aama» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Iira qayqayon dhuman E aafto goozin, fa kushito aykkii kaalitsize as koyitera wutida. <verse eid="ACT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12"/>Gade ahize yinno bi7ide wode Laatstse baz tamaarssizanne gaama qoppii ammanida.<verse eid="ACT 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Barnnabaasan Phawuloosan Phisidiya Anxookiya qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13"/>Phawuloosan eera yezuntsi Phaafuppa denddii, Phinfiliya yeze Phergge markkabera qitida. Wahannisa unttappa shaakkintti Yerusalaame maaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14"/>Yezin un Pherggeppa aadhii Phisidiya yeze Anxookiya yellida. Sambbata wode Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelii bettida. <verse eid="ACT 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15"/>Muse higgiton nabunts maxaaftan nabbabinttidannippa maaqqii Ayhude woosa Keetstsi hyalaquntsi, «Nu ishuntso, asi mintsitsize qaala yinttis yezako asuntsis ohoyate» ga7i unttago kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16"/>Phawuloosa denddii eqqii fa kushtira mallitera, «Isra7eele asuntsis, mahi Xooz goynize Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntso, si7ote. <verse eid="ACT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17"/>Hyantsi Isra7eele asunts Xoozze, nu mayzuntsana doorida. Gibxxe sa7a zaqqotitsa un yessadera, unttana gaantsi fa damma wolqqara Gibxxe sa7appa unttana kessida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Keze 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">Keze 12:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18"/>Akko baayze sa7a oyttam bere gaar unttana dandda7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Faydo 14:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31">Mahe 1:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19"/>Kanaane sa7a Ayhude maaqqoosse laappun ka7itumo kayi un gadito fa asuntsana laattizida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Mahe 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Iya. 14:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20"/>Yinna ubba hyanidannippa oyddii xeet ichintam bere maaqqida. Yinnippa maaqqii Saamu7eela wode yellodes ahize daynna unttis inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:16">Mahe 2:16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1 Sam. 3:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, un faas kaati inggode gaar woossin, Xoozii Biniyame kochchappa Qiise na7a, Saawula oyttam bere ka7itode gaar unttis inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:5">1 Sam. 8:5</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:21">10:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22"/>Xoozii Saawula shaaridannippa maaqqii unttalla Dawute ka7itsida. Xoozii Dawutebaz markkidhite, ‹Ta wozintti gaar maaqqidaya ta qoftto ubba oochchiza Issey na7a Dawute denggida› gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1 Sam. 13:14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Maz. 89:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23"/>«Xoozii, taanii Dawute kochchappa Isra7eele asuntsana ufayssiza ko7oda gaydanni gaar Yesuusa ki7ida. <verse eid="ACT 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24"/>Yesuusa yo7odannippa tiino Isra7eele asuntsi ubba fa nagarttippa maaqqii xammaqinttode gaar Wahannisa qaala ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luqa. 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25"/>Mahi Wahannisa fa oochchito folodes yi7ite asuntsago, ‹Tana oona ga7i qoppete? Taanii yin naagize Kiristtoosa baaya, yezin ta E caamma billodes taas beezoosse taappa suubite ye7ine› gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Maato. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:7">Mar. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luqa. 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:20">Waha. 1:20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26"/>«Ishuntso, Abrahama kochchuntso, mahi hyanne Ayhude maaqqikaayzara Xoozis zhashtizuntso, hyanna ashshize qaaltta nuus kiitinttida. <verse eid="ACT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27"/>Akkos gayko, Yerusalaame yeze asuntsin un hyalaquntsi Yesuusa erikaaya. Sambbata ubbanne nabbabinttize nabunts qaaltto tiirikaayze gisho ezalla firddi nabuntsi ohide qaaltto folida. <verse eid="ACT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28"/>Yesuusa wodhissades fettii miknaaten benttaanxin Philaaxoosa eza wodhodes inggode gaar woossida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Maato. 27:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:13-14">Mar. 15:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:21-23">Luqa. 23:21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:15">Waha. 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29"/>Un Yesuusa baz Geeshi Maxaafite xaafinttidanno ubba folide wode masqalappa eza ketstsii moogida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Maato. 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Waha. 19:38-42</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30"/>Yezin Xoozii hyayqoppa Yesuusa dentsida. <verse eid="ACT 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, E faara Galilappa Yerusalaame yi7iduntsis gaama qamma benttida. Un hyatte E baz asuntsis markkidhane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">Hawa. 1:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32"/>«Xoozii nu aduntsis inggoda gayde Wonggele nuunii yinttis ohine. <verse eid="ACT 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33"/>Dawute fa Mazmure Maxaafite lam7intsa zofantte,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">« ‹Neenii, ta Na7aya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">ta hyayno nena yelida›</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 13:33">ga7intti xaafinttide Yesuusa, Xoozii hyayqoppa dentsii nu mayzuntsis inggoda gaydanno nuus un na7untsis folida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz. 2:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34"/>E wooqaame gaar Xoozii hyayqoppa eza dentsite erisodes,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">« ‹Taanii Dawutes inggoda gayde</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:34">ammaninttide geeshi anjjo yinttis inggoda› yaga7i ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:3">Isa. 55:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35"/>«Yinnii gisho, Mazmure Maxaafite melle bessa mahi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:35">« ‹Ne Geeshize ahito wooqqizoos› gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Maz. 16:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36"/>«Dawute fa wode Xoozze qoftto folidannippa maaqqii hyayqqii fa aduntsara mooginttii wooqqida. <verse eid="ACT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37"/>Yezin Xoozii hyayqoppa dentsiday wooqqikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38"/>«Yinnii gisho, ta ishuntso, nagara ashshize Yesuusa zalara tiinidhdhii yinttis ohinttidanno erote. Muse higgita nagarappa xillissades dandda7oos. <verse eid="ACT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39"/>Yezin Yesuusa ammanze ubbuntsi nagarappa xillane. <verse eid="ACT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40"/>Yinnii gisho, nabuntsi gaydanna yinttana yellaame fana naaginttote.<verse eid="ACT 13:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41"/>« ‹Xoozii gaydebaz leqqizuntso! Bo7ote!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">Gaama qoppote! Dhabote!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:41">Ooden ohin, yin ammanoose oocha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:41">ta yin wodite oochchoda› » yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:5">Ibr. 1:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42"/>Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan Ayhude woosa keetstsappa kessadera, kaallize Sambbata yinno gujjii ohode gaar asuntsi unttana woossida. <verse eid="ACT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43"/>Shiiqita lanttidannippa maaqqii gaama Ayhuduntsin Ayhudunts ammantte gelii Xooz goynize gaamuntsi Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan kaallida. Ammaniduntsii Xoozze aadho keehatitsite mintstsii yessade gaar unttana zorida.<verse eid="ACT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44"/>Lam7intsa Sambbata katama yeze asuntsappa attide baaya yagawude wontsis Xoozze qaala si7odes shiiqida. <verse eid="ACT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45"/>Yezin Ayhuduntsi gaama asuntsana be7eze wode Phawuloosa antsinttii E ohito ixxii eza cazhida.<verse eid="ACT 13:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46"/>Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan zhashtikaayzara, «Xoozze qaaltta tiinidhdhii yinttis ohinttodes beezane. Yezin yin qaala ixxii medhina de7o ekkodes nuus beezoos ga7i yin, yin ommite firddide gisho yikke nuunii Ayhude maaqqoosuntsago maaqqada. <verse eid="ACT 13:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47"/>Akkos gayko Laatstsi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:47">« ‹Alame kumutsita ne baggara attode gaar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:47">ta nena Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis foo7o mahida› ga7i nuna kiittida» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 13:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48"/>Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi yinno si7ide wode ufaytti Xoozze qaala bonchchida. Mahi medhina de7oos doorinttide ubba ammanida.<verse eid="ACT 13:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49"/>Laatstse qaaltta yinna sa7ito ubba yellida. <verse eid="ACT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50"/>Yezin Ayhuduntsi, Ayhude maaqqoosse Xooz goynize bonchchinttide maachuntsanan katama yeze damma asuntsana Phawuloosallan Barnnabaasallan dentsitsida. Yentsi asuntsi unttana bay7e aykkii fa sa7itippa kessida. <verse eid="ACT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51"/>Yezin Phawuloosaran Barnnabaasaran ixxizuntsis malla maaqqade gaar fa tohitippa xura fixxii Iqooniyone katama qitida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Maato. 10:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:11">Mar. 6:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luqa. 9:5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:11">10:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52"/>Mahi Anxookiya yeze ammanzuntsi Geeshi Ayyaanaran ufayssara kumida.<verse eid="ACT 13:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan Iqooniyone qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1"/>Kasennigaara, Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan Iqooniyonen Ayhudunts woosa keetstsa gelii gaama Ayhuduntsin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi ammanode wodes qaala ohida. <verse eid="ACT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2"/>Yezin ammanikaayze Ayhuduntsi, Ayhude maaqqoosutsi wozintto laammii ishuntsalla dentsitsida. <verse eid="ACT 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3"/>Hawaaruntsi ize gaama wode gam77ida. Un zhashtikaayzara Laatstse baz ohida. Laatstsii mallan kille baz un oochchode gaar unttis adetits wolqqa inggi fa aadho keehatitsi qaaltta turo maaqqizanno beezida. <verse eid="ACT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4"/>Yezin yentsi katama asuntsi shaakkintti, baggita Ayhuduntsara baggita mahi Hawaaruntsara maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5"/>Ayhude maaqqoosuntsin Ayhuduntsin fa hyalaquntsara wolla maaqqii hawaaruntsana qohodesin shuchchara dhogodes koyda. <verse eid="ACT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6"/>Hawaaruntsi yinno erii, Lisxiran Derbbe ga7inttize Liqaa7oniya katamuntsi giddan un guta yeze sa7a aachinttida. <verse eid="ACT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7"/>Ize Wonggele ohida.<verse eid="ACT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosaran Barnnabaasara Lisxiran Darbben</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8"/>Yelinttidannippa aykkii lam77i tohita wobbin yedhdhii eroosse fettii asi Lisxira yene. <verse eid="ACT 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9"/>Ye atstsay Phawuloosa ohodera bettii si7ine. Phawuloosa eza dakkii be7ize wode faxodes ees ammano yezanno bi7i, <verse eid="ACT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10"/>fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Moolii ne tohitira eqqo» yagayda. Yeezin, doollii denddii eqqii yedhdhe aykkida.<verse eid="ACT 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11"/>Phawuloosa oochchidanno asuntsi bi7i fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii Liqaa7oniya doonara, «Eequntsi asi aazii nuugo wodhdhida» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12"/>Barnnabaasa, «Diya» ga7i, Phawuloosa ohize waannize gisho eza, «Hermmeene» ga7i suntsida. <verse eid="ACT 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13"/>Katamappa gaxa yeze Diya goyno keetstsa kahinzen asuntsi kormman bonchcho fudhe hawaaruntsis zharshodes koyi katama furtsa ki7ida.<verse eid="ACT 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14"/>Yezin Barnnabaasan Phawuloosan yinno si7eze wode un oochchodes qoppidanno ixxii fa ma7ito feedhida. Asunts gidda woxxii gelii, <verse eid="ACT 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15"/>fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Asuntso, hyanno akkos oochchete? Nuunin yin fana asi. Hyanna fatstsoosse bazitippa salon sa7an, abba un gidda yeze ubbabazito medhdhide de7o Xoozzego yin maaqqade gaar yinttis nuunii Wonggele ohine.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Keze 20:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Maz. 146:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16"/>E zaga asuntsana fa ogito yedhdhade gaar dakkii ashshida. <verse eid="ACT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17"/>Yezin ira saloppa bukkizida, katstsan woder woder inggida, katstsa inggi yinttana gaama ufayssida, yeyzi yinttis lo77o baz oochchii faas markka dhabsikaaya» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18"/>Hawaaruntsi yinno ga7i faas asuntsi zharshaame gaar waayi kayda.<verse eid="ACT 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19"/>Anxookiyappan Iqooniyoneppan yi7ide Ayhuduntsi, asuntsana fa zala mahi shuchchara Phawuloosa dhogida. Unttis E hyayqqide gaar aazin katamappa gaxa gochchii kanggi olida. <verse eid="ACT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20"/>Yezin ammanzuntsi yi7i, E kale wutii eqqezin E denddii katama gelida. Wonttisti wode Barnnabaasara wolla Darbbe qitida.<verse eid="ACT 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan Sooriya Anxookiya maaqqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21"/>Un Darbbe katama Wonggele ohi gaamuntsana ammanzuntsana mahidannip suuba Lisxira, Iqooniyonen Phisidiya Anxookiya maaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22"/>Ize ammanzuntsi ammanora miinggi yessade gaar zorii, «Xoozze ka7itumo gelodes nuunii gaama madha ekkodes beezane» yaga7i tamaarssida. <verse eid="ACT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23"/>Mahi woosa keetstsis ommite ommite cimuntsana doorida. Xoomidannippan woossidannippa maaqqii un ammanize Laatstses un hyadarito inggidda.<verse eid="ACT 14:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24"/>Phisidiya sa7a kantsii aadhii Phinfiliya qitida. <verse eid="ACT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25"/>Pherggen qaala ohidannippa maaqqii Axaaliya qitida. <verse eid="ACT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26"/>Iippa un fa folide oochitis Xoozze aadho keehatitsitis unttis hyadara inggide Anxookiya markkabera maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27"/>Anxookiya yelide wode woosa keetstsa asuntsana shiishii Xoozii unttara oochchide oochito ubba Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi ammanode gaar unttis wayzi furtsi bugezako ohida. <verse eid="ACT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28"/>Ezin ammanzuntsara gaama wode gam77ida.<verse eid="ACT 14:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalaame shiiqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1"/>Fettii fettii asuntsi Yihudappa Anxookiya hyanggi, «Muse wogiti gaar yin garrazinttanxiko attodes dandda7oos» ga7i ammanzuntsana tamaarsse aykkida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Leewe 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2"/>Yinna Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan unttara gaama lallode gaaran kacinttode gaar yiizida. Yinnii gisho, Anxookiya yeze fettii fettii asuntsi Phawuloosaran Barnnabaasara Yerusalaame hyanggi Hawaaruntsara cimuntsara yellintti yinna ohito billode gaar qofa accinttida.<verse eid="ACT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3"/>Woosa keetsita unttana kiittin qitida. Un Finqeran Samaarera aadhittera Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi Xoozago wayzi maaqqezako ohida. Yinna ammanzuntsana ubba gaama ufayssida. <verse eid="ACT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4"/>Un Yerusalaame yellide wode woosa keetsita, Hawaaruntsin cimuntsi unttana mokkida. Xoozii unttara oochchidanno ubba ohida. <verse eid="ACT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5"/>Yezin Farisaawunts baggappa ammanide fettii fettii asuntsi denddii eqqii, «Ayhude maaqqoosse ammanize asuntsi garrazinttodesin Muse higgito naagodes beezane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6"/>Hawaaruntsin cimuntsi yinno zorinttodes shiiqida. <verse eid="ACT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7"/>Gaama ohinttidannippa maaqqii, Phexiroosa denddii eqqii, «Ta ishuntso, Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi Wonggele qaala ta doonappa si7i ammanode gaar tiinidhii tana Xoozii yin giddappa dooridanno yin erane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">Hawa. 10:1-43</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8"/>As wozina erize Xoozze Geeshi Ayyaana nuus inggidannigaar unttisin inggi turizida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">Hawa. 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10:44</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9"/>Ammanora un wozintto geeshide gisho nu giddan un gidda shaako gaddikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10"/>Yinnii gisho, nu aduntsin nuunii tookkodes dandda7oos qambbara ammanzuntsi geetalla gaddii hyatte akkos Xooz fattanete? <verse eid="ACT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11"/>Laatstse Yesuus aadho keehatitsite un attidanni gaara nuunin attidanno ammanane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12"/>Asuntsi si77i ga7i, Barnnabaasan Phawuloosa Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts gidda un baggara Xoozii oochchide mallan kille bazi ubba ohodera si7ine.<verse eid="ACT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13"/>Un ohi hyaasidannippa maaqqii Yayqooba, «Ishuntso, ta gaazanno si7ote. <verse eid="ACT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14"/>Xoozii Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi gidda fa fa suntsito xeegize worzha doorodes koyi unttana tiino wayzi qoppezako Simoona ohida. <verse eid="ACT 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15"/>Nabunts qaaltta hyannira giigane. Geeshi Maxaafite,<verse eid="ACT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16"/>« ‹Hyannippa suuba, ta maaqqada,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Woddide Dawute keetsito keexxoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:16-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo. 9:11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">Wul7inttide keetsiton mahi essoda.<verse eid="ACT 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17-18"/>Attide asuntsi ubba taago ye7oda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">ta xeegide Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsi ubba tana koyoda. Zagappa aykkii yinna erinttode fana yiizide</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17-18">Laatstse, ohine› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 15:17-18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19"/>«Yinnii gisho, ta qoftta Xoozago maaqqize Ayhude maaqqoosuntsana nuunii waaytsosako lo77o. <verse eid="ACT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20"/>Yezin un eeqas zharshinttii tunidebaz ma7aame gaar, olalaame gaar, bawuta ma7aame gaaran suutsi uzhaame gaaran ma7aame gaar unttis nuunii dabddaabbe xaafodes beezane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Keze 34:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Leewe 17:10-16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:6-23">18:6-23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21"/>Muse higge zagappa aykkii Sambbata Sambbata Ayhude woosa keetstsa nabbabinttii katama ubba sabbakinttane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, hawaaruntsin cimuntsi woosa keetstsa as ubbuntsara fettilla fa gidda fa eerats asuntsana doorii Phawuloosaran Barnnabaasara Anxookiya dakkodes qofa accida. Gaama erinttide kaalitsizuntsana Barssabaasa ga7inttize Yihudan Sillaasen doorida. <verse eid="ACT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23"/>Hyannigaara ga7intti dabddaabbe unttalla dakkida: «Nu hawaaruntsin cimuntsi yin ishuntsi, Anxookiya, Sooriya Kilqiya yeze Ayhude maaqqoosse ishuntsis nu sarotits kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24"/>«Nuunii kiittikaayze asuntsi nu giddappa hyanggi, ‹Yin garrazinttodesin higgito naagodes beezane› ga7i, yinttana waaytsidannon zhilizidanno si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25"/>Nuunii kadhize Barnnabaasan Phawuloosa doorinttide asuntsara wolla yinttago dakkodes fettii wozinara nu qoftto accida. <verse eid="ACT 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26"/>Un nu Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa gisho fa de7ito aatsii inggida. <verse eid="ACT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27"/>Yinnii gisho, nu xaafidanno un fa doonara gujjii yinttis ohode fana Yihudan Sillaasen kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28"/>«Hyanna koshshizuntsap attin melle toofo yinttana toossame gaar nuunin Geeshi Ayyaana ohito accida. <verse eid="ACT 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29"/>Eeqas zharshinttii tunidebaz mu7ippete, suutsi uzhippete, bawuta mu7ippete, olalippete. Hyantsi ubbappa yin, yin ommito naagiko lo77o baz oochchane. Lo77o yezote» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30"/>Yinnii gisho, kiitinttiduntsi moyzinttii Anxookiya qitii ammanze asuntsana shiishii, dabddaabbiza inggidda. <verse eid="ACT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31"/>Un ye mintsitsize dabddaabbiza nabbabide wode ufayttida. <verse eid="ACT 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32"/>Mahi Yihudan Sillaasen fa ommite nabuntsana maaqqide gisho ammanzuntsana loytsii zorii mintsitsida. <verse eid="ACT 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33"/>Un Anxookiya eeratsi wode bettidannippa suuba ammanze ishuntsi loytsi moyzin fana kiittezuntsago maaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34"/>[Yezin Sillaasen ize attodes koyda.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii kushera xaafide maxaafite faydo 34 baaya. </char></note><verse eid="ACT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35"/>Mahi Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan melle gaama asuntsara wolla Laatstse qaala tamaarssitera Wonggele ohitera Anxookiya gam77ida.<verse eid="ACT 15:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosan Barnnabaasan shaakkinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36"/>Eerats qammappa suuba Phawuloosa Barnnabaasago, «Nu Laatstse qaala ohide katamite ubba ammanizuntsi wayzi yezako suuba maaqqitera be7ada» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37"/>Barnnabaasa Marqqoosa ga7inttize Wahannisa faara hyammade fana koyda. <verse eid="ACT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38"/>Yezin Phawuloosa Marqqoosa faara hyammade fana koykaaya. Akkos gayko, E Phinfiliya shaakkintti unttara oochchodes hyanggikaaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Hawa. 13:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39"/>Un gidda iita kachchi kezin fetay fetayppa shaakkinttida. Barnnabaasa Marqqoosa ekkii markkabera Qoophiroosa qitida. <verse eid="ACT 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40"/>Yezin Phawuloosa Sillaase doorida; ammanzuntsi Phawuloosa Xoozze aadho keehatitsi hyadarito inggidannippa maaqqii E kezii qitida. <verse eid="ACT 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41"/>Yeyzi, woosa keetstsi mintsitsitera Sooriyaran Kilqiyaran wutida.<verse eid="ACT 15:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Ximotiyoosa Phawuloosaran Sillaasera yellinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1"/>Phawuloosa Darbben Lisxiran qitida. Ize Ximotiyoosa gaaze ammanize asi yene. E intta ammanze Ayhude maacho, E aday Girike asi. <verse eid="ACT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2"/>Lisxiran Iqooniyone yeze ammanzuntsi Ximotiyoosa baz loytsii markkidhida. <verse eid="ACT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3"/>Phawuloosa Ximotiyoosa faara ekkodes koyi, E aday Girike asi maaqqidanno yinna besite yeze Ayhude ubbuntsi erize gisho eza garrazida. <verse eid="ACT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4"/>Un katamara aadhitter Yerusalaame yeze hawaaruntsin cimuntsin accide qoftto ammanzuntsi naagode gaar unttis ohitera aadhida. <verse eid="ACT 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5"/>Yinnii gisho, woosa keetsita ammanora miinggite, faydoran qammite qammite gaanggitter hyanggida.<verse eid="ACT 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Maqedooniya qitode gaar xeeginttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6"/>Isiya gidda qaala ohaame gaar Geeshi Ayyaana unttana kayde gisho Phirggeran Galaatiya sa7ara aadhida. <verse eid="ACT 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7"/>Un Miisiya gaxa yellide wode Bitiiniya qitodes qoppida yeshsha. Yezin Yesuusa Ayyaana unttana kayda. <verse eid="ACT 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8"/>Yinnii gisho, un Miisiya kalera aadhitera Xiro7aada wodhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9"/>Phawuloosa qamma qonccitsara fettii Maqedooniya asi faago, «Maqedooniya fiinggi nuna maaddoya» ga7i eqqii woossodera bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10"/>Qonccitsi E bi7idannippa maaqqii nu Maqedooniya qitodes koyda. Yinnan, Wonggele ize yeze asuntsis ohodes Xoozii nuna xeegida aazida.<verse eid="ACT 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Liidiya Kiristtoosa ammanida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11"/>Xiro7aadappa denddii markkabe gidda gelii Samotiraaqe hyanggide, wonttisti wode Naaphule hyanggida. <verse eid="ACT 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12"/>Izippa denddii Maqedooniya sa7a yeze Filphisiyusa ga7inttize worada katama hyanggida. Mahi Filphisiyusa Roomuntsi ahize katama. Nu yinna katamite eeratsi wode bettida.<verse eid="ACT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13"/>Sambbata wode katamappa gaxa borkka doona Ayhuduntsi Xoozze woossize bessi yezanno qoppii ize hyanggida. Yinna besite shiiqide maachuntsis qaala ohida.<verse eid="ACT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14"/>Nuna si7ize asuntsappa fettii Liidiya ga7inttize Tiyaxiroone katamappa yi7ide, Xooz ammanze zoqo ma7o zal77ize, maachita yene. Phawuloosa ohizanno iza si7ode gaar Laatstsii I wozintto bugida. <verse eid="ACT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15"/>Liidiya fa kara asuntsara wolla xammaqinttidannippa maaqqii nuugo, «Yin tana Laatstsa turo ammanida gayko ta kara yi7i shemppote» ga7i mintsii woossida.<verse eid="ACT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosan Sillaasen acinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16"/>Nu Xooz woossize besite hyanggodera iita ayyaana iilla afa yezii maridhdhize fettii wudur arita nuura yellinttida. Iza maridhdhii gaama bira fa laatstsuntsis ke7ine. <verse eid="ACT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17"/>Phawuloosan nunan kaallii, «Hyantses Ubbappa kattara Xoozze aruntsana! Un yin attode ogito ohizuntsana» ga7i uukkida.<verse eid="ACT 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18"/>Ubba wode yinnii gaar gaane. Yezin Phawuloosa zhilidhdhi suub maaqqii, ye ayyaanza, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa suntsite iippa kezo» ga7i kiittida. Iira iita ayyaanze iippa kezida.<verse eid="ACT 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19"/>Yezin I laatstsuntsi faas bira denggize ogita dhabidanno bi7i, Phawuloosan Sillaasen aykkii, firdda keetstsa daynnuntsi tiino gochchii kanggida. <verse eid="ACT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20"/>Daynnuntsi tiino unttana kanggi, «Hyantses Ayhude asi maaqqii nu katama asuntsana gaama waaytstsane. <verse eid="ACT 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21"/>Nu Roome gade asuntsi ekkodesin oochchodes woga maaqqoosse baz tamaarssane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22"/>Asuntsi fettii zala maaqqii, Phawuloosallan Sillaaselan denddida. Daynnuntsi un ma7ito gaarii gufer unttana guuddade fana kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23"/>Unttana gaama hyadhdhidannippa suuba achi keetstsa geltsida. Achi keetstsito kafizay unttana mintsii kafode gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24"/>Achi keetstsito kafize yinna kiitto ekkii, Phawuloosan Sillaasen achi keetstsitis qol7a geltsida. Un tohito dutstsara accida.<verse eid="ACT 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25"/>Yezin qamma bilahe maaqqize wode Phawuloosaran Sillaaseran woossitteran mazmure yexxitteran Xooz galatane. Achi keetstsite yeze melle asuntsin un gaazanno si7ine.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul and Silas in stocks" file="LB00337B.TIF" size="span" ref="16:25">Phawuloosan Sillaasen achchi keetsa </figure> <verse eid="ACT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26"/>Qoppikaayzin achi keetsiti sa7ita en7inttode wontsis sa7a en7ida. Yinna saatte furtsita ubba bugunttii attida; acinttide asuntsi ubbuntsi santsalaata bilinttii wodhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27"/>Achi keetstsito kafize genttoppa barkkide wode achi keetsiti furtsita ubba bugunttidanno bi7i acinttide asuntsi kessii ekkii qitide gaar aazin fana wodhodes mashsha ekkida. <verse eid="ACT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28"/>Yezin Phawuloosa fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii «Nu ubbanna hyanne yeze gisho ne nena qohippe» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29"/>Achi keetstsito kafize xomppe woossii ekkii ellisii gidda woxxida. Goqitera Phawuloosa tiinon Sillaase tiino zuggida. <verse eid="ACT 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30"/>Unttana bale kessii, «Ta laatstsuntso, ta attodes akko oochchodes beeze?» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31"/>Phawuloosaran Sillaasera eego, «Laatstsi Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammano; neeran ne kara asuntsaran attoda» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32"/>Un eesin E kara yeze ubbuntsis Laatstse qaala ohida. <verse eid="ACT 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33"/>Qamma yinna saatte achi keetsito kafize unttana kanggi un hyarggize bessito meeccida. Ellisii fa kara as ubbuntsara xammaqinttida. <verse eid="ACT 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34"/>Phawuloosan Sillaasen fa kara kanggi unttis katstsa aatstsida. E fa kara asi ubbuntsara Xooz ammanide gisho ufayttida.<verse eid="ACT 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35"/>Sa7ita wonttin daynnuntsi, «Yentsi asuntsana billo» yaga7i foolisuntsana eego kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 16:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36"/>Achi keetsito kafize, «Yin bilinttode gaar daynnuntsi kiittida. Yikke, kezii saro qitote» yaga7i yinna kiitto Phawuloosas ohida.<verse eid="ACT 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37"/>Yezin Phawuloosa yentsi foolisuntsago, «Nu Roome asi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Roome as: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phawuloosa Roome as yaga7i fana xeegidanna ye wode Ayhude sa7a ahize Roome ka7itumo maaqqide gisho. Ye wode Roome sa7ite yeze asuntsi firdda baayzin garafinttoos. </char></note> maaqqadera un nuna firdda baytsi as tiino hyadhdhii, achi keetstsa olida. Hyatte nuna aachintti kezii qito gaane? Hyanoos, un fa ommitis yi7i nuna kesso» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 16:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38"/>Foolisuntsi daynnuntsis yinno ohin, Phawuloosaran Sillaaseran Roome sa7a asi maaqqidanno si7ide wode zhashtida. <verse eid="ACT 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39"/>Yinnii gisho, daynnuntsi yi7i unttago, Nu yinttana qohida yaga7i maarotitsi oocida. Achi keetsitippa bale unttana kessii, katamappa kezii qitode gaar woossida. <verse eid="ACT 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40"/>Phawuloosaran Sillaaseran achi keetsitippa kezii Liidiya kara hyanggida. Ize ammanzuntsara yellintti unttana mintsitsii kezii qitida.<verse eid="ACT 16:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Teselonqe tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1"/>Phawuloosara Sillaaseran Amfipholisaran Apholoniyara aadhii Teselonqe qitida. Ize Ayhude woosa keetstsi yene. <verse eid="ACT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2"/>Phawuloosa zaganni gaara ize gelida. Ize hyaydzdzii sambbata Xoozze qaalappa asuntsis ohida. <verse eid="ACT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3"/>Kiristtoosa madha ekkodesin hyayqoppa denddodesin beezanno unttis geeshi ohitera, «Yesuusa hyay ta yinttis ohizay Kiristtoosa» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4"/>Unttappa fete fete ohidanna turo maaqqidanno ekkii Phawuloosaran Sillaasera wolla fetto maaqqida. Yinnii fana, Xooz goynize gaama Girike asuntsin gaama bonchchinttide maachuntsin unttara wolla maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5"/>Yezin Ayhuduntsi ixxii fettii fettii oocha baayze iita asuntsana ogeppa shiishida. Katamito buqe aykkida; Phawuloosan Sillaasen asuntsis aatsii inggodes koyi Iyaasone keetstsito teqqida. <verse eid="ACT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6"/>Phawuloosan Sillaasen unttis benttaanxin, Iyaasonen fettii fettii ammanzuntsana katama hyalaquntsago gochchii kanggi, «Hyantses sa7ito ubba buqizuntsi hyatte nuugo yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7"/>Iyaasone unttana fa kara gaddida. Hyantses, ‹Yesuusa gaaze melle kaati yene› ga7i Qeesare kiitto ixxane» ga7i dhoqi gayde qaalara ohida.<verse eid="ACT 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8"/>Shiiqide asuntsin katama hyalaquntsi yinno si7i hyanodebaz dhabida. <verse eid="ACT 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9"/>Hyalaquntsi Iyaasonan melluntsana waaser billida.<verse eid="ACT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Beeriya tamaarssida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10"/>Ammanzuntsi Phawuloosan Sillaasen qammara Beeriya dakkida. Beeriya yellii, Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelida. <verse eid="ACT 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11"/>Beeriya asuntsi Teselonqe asuntsappa aadhii wozina dalgga. Un qaaltto kumutsi wozinappa ekkida; Phawuloosa gaydanna turo maaqqidanno shaakkii erodes ubba wode Geeshi Maxaafe nabbabane. <verse eid="ACT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12"/>Yinnii gisho, unttappa gaamuntsi, Girikuntsappa bonchchinttide gaama maachuntsin gaama dhiiratsuntsii ammanida.<verse eid="ACT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13"/>Yezin Teselonqe yeze Ayhuduntsi Phawuloosa Xoozze qaala Beeriy giddan ohidanno si7ide wode Beeriya yi7i asuntsana buqida. <verse eid="ACT 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14"/>Yinnippa maaqqii, ammanzuntsi ellisii Phawuloosa abba kale dakkida. Yezin Sillaasen Ximotiyoosan Beeriya attida. <verse eid="ACT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15"/>Phawuloosa moyzide asuntsi Ateena yeltsida. Yentsi asuntsi Sillaasen Ximotiyoosan faas dandda7inttide gaar ellisii faago ye7ode gaar Phawuloosa kiitteze kiitto ekkii Beeriya maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Ateena qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16"/>Phawuloosa Ateena Sillaasen Ximotiyoosan kafittera, katama eeqa kumidanno bi7i zhilidhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17"/>Yinnii gisho, Ayhude woosa Keetsite Ayhuduntsaran Xooz goynize Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsara mahi faara yellinttize asuntsara ubba wode gabe lallane. <verse eid="ACT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18"/>Ephiqoroosan Isttoyke ga7inttize bagguntsappa fettii fettii eruntsi Phawuloosara wolla lallida. Unttappa fete fete, «Hyay canccize akko ohodes koye?» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Melluntsi Phawuloosa Yesuusan hyayqoppa denddo baz faas ohide gisho «Melle eequntsi baz ohiza aazane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19"/>Phawuloosa aykkii Aryoospaagosa gaaze shiiqo besite kanggi, «Hyanna ne tamaarssize kille bazita akko yezakon nuna eriso? <verse eid="ACT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20"/>Akkos gayko, ne nuus kille baz ohine; yikke yinna akko yezakon nu erodes koyane» yagayda.<figure style="fig" alt="Paul speaking to the Areopagus" file="cn02136b.tif" size="span" ref="17:16">Phawuloosa Aryoospaagosa asuntsis markkidhane </figure> <verse eid="ACT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21"/>Ateena asuntsi ubbuntsin ize yeze zaqquntsi kille baz ohikaayzaran si7ikaayzaran feezhoos.<verse eid="ACT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22"/>Phawuloosa Aryoospaagosa gidda shiiqide asuntsi tiino eqqii, «Ateena asuntso, yin eequntsis ubba baza gaama zhashtizanno ta bi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23"/>Taanii yin katamara wutittera yin goynize besite be7ize wode ‹Erinttoose Xoozzes› ga7intti xaafinttide zharsho bessito denggida. Hyanna yin erikaayzara goynizaya ta yinttis ohoda. <verse eid="ACT 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24"/>Sa7an sa7alla yeze ubbabazito medhdhide Xoozze, salon sa7a Laatstse, asi keexxide keetstsa yezoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:27">1 Kat. 8:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa. 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">Hawa. 7:48</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25"/>E de7o, shemppon ubba baz as ubbas inggide gisho face yeze asi fana as maade koyoos. <verse eid="ACT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26"/>Xoozii un yessade wodesin bessis wuzula inggida. Yinnippa as kochchi ubba fettii asappa medhdhii sa7a ubba gaddida. <verse eid="ACT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27"/>E yinno oochchidanna asi eza koyode fanan qurichchi denggode fana. Maaqqikon E nuuppa hyaako baaya. <verse eid="ACT 17:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28"/>Yinttappa fettii fettii yexxizuntsi, ‹Nu E na7untsana› maaqqidanni fana, Nu E gidda faxa yene, en7inttane. <verse eid="ACT 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29"/>Yikke, nu Xoozze na7untsana maaqqide gisho ‹Xoozii as yiillatitsaran qofara worqqappa woy birappa woy shuchchappa oochinttidebaz aazane› ga7i qoppodes beezoos. <verse eid="ACT 17:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozii tiino wode asi erikaayzara oochchidanno ashshii aadhida, yezin hyatte ubba bessa yeze asi ubba nagarappa maaqqade gaar kiittane. <verse eid="ACT 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31"/>Akkos gayko, Xoozii fa dooride atstsera sa7alla yeze asi ubballa xillo firdda firddodes qamma giigizii gaddida. Eza hyayqoppa dentsii yinno as ubbas geeshida» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 17:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32"/>Unttappa fettii fettii asuntsi hyayqoppa denddebaz Phawuloosappa si7i, eza leqqida. Yezin melluntsi, «Nuunii yinno neeppa gujjii si7odes koyane» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33"/>Yinnii gisho, Phawuloosa un giddappa kezida. <verse eid="ACT 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34"/>Yezin fettii fettii dhiiratsuntsii Phawuloosara yellii ammanida. Un giddappa Aryoospaagosan shiiqite yeze Diyonasyoosa gaaze atstse, Damariso gaaze fettii maachitan melluntsin unttara yene.<verse eid="ACT 17:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Qoronttoosa qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1"/>Yinnippa suuba, Phawuloosa Ateenappa kezii, Qoronttoosa qitida. <verse eid="ACT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2"/>Ize Aqiila gaaze Phanxoosa yelinttide fettii Ayhude as denggida. Ayhude asuntsana ubba Roomeppa kessade gaar kaati Qalawudiyoosa kiittide gisho eeratsi wodeppa tiino E fa machchitii Phirisqilara Xaaleppa yi7ida. Phawuloosa unttara yellinttodes hyanggida. <verse eid="ACT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3"/>E oochita unttinnigaara dunkkaane sikke maaqqide gisho unttara bettii wolla oochchida. <verse eid="ACT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4"/>Phawuloosa Sambbata ubba Ayhuduntsanan Girikuntsana ammantsodes Ayhude woosa Keetstsa miinggi ohine.<verse eid="ACT 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5"/>Sillaasen Ximotiyoosan Maqedooniyappa yi7ide wode Phawuloosa fa kumutsi wodito inggi Ayhuduntsis Yesuusa E, Kiristtoosa ga7i qaala ohida. <verse eid="ACT 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6"/>Yezin un Phawuloosa ixxii eza cazhin Phawuloosa fa ma7itippa xura tiqizi, «Yin gomtta yinttana yello; ta yinne yezoos. Yikkeppa suuba, ta Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsago qitane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7"/>Izip kezii Xooz goynize Titoos Yosxoosa gaaze atstse kara qitida. Yosxoosa keetsita Ayhude woosa Keetstsi kale yene. <verse eid="ACT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8"/>Ayhude woosa Keetsiti hyalaqize Qarisphoosa fa kara asuntsi ubbuntsara Laatstsii ammanida. Qoronttoosa asuntsappa gaamuntsi Xooz qaala si7ide wode ammanii xammaqinttida.<verse eid="ACT 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9"/>Laatstsii fettii qamma Phawuloosas benttii, «Zhashtippe; oho, si77i gayppe. <verse eid="ACT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10"/>Taanii neera yene. Taas hyanna katamite, gaama asi yeze gisho nena qohii iitabessa olode asi ooden baaya» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11"/>Yinnii gisho, Phawuloosa Xoozze qaala asuntsana tamaarssittera fettii beren izippun agina unttara bettida.<verse eid="ACT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12"/>Gaaliyoosa Akkaya sa7a ahize wode Ayhuduntsi fettilla Phawuloosalla denddii firdda keetstsa eza kanggi, <verse eid="ACT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13"/>«Hyay atstsay higge ixxii, asuntsi Xooz goynode gaar yiizane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14"/>Phawuloosa ohodes yi7adera, Gaaliyoosa Ayhuduntsago, «Ayhuduntso, yinna iita oocha woy qohe maaqqiko ta yin baz dandda7i si7odes beezane. <verse eid="ACT 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15"/>Yezin qaalasin, suntsisin yin higgitisin yin lallizebaz maaqqiko yin, yinttis billote; yinno ta firddoos» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16"/>Yeyzi, unttana firdda keetstsappa bale kessida. <verse eid="ACT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17"/>Yinnippa suuba, asuntsi ubba Ayhude woosa Keetstsa hyalaqiza Sostenisa aykkii firdda keetstsi tiino hyadhdhida. Yezin Gaaliyoosas yinna akkon aazikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Anxookiya qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18"/>Phawuloosa gaama wode Qoronttoosa gidda bettidanippa suuba ammanze asuntsana sarotsi, Phirisqiliran Aqiilara markkabera Sooriya qitida. Yezin E qitodannippa tiino faas qayinggidebaz yeze gisho Kinkkiriya katama fa ommito medinttida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:18">Faydo 6:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19"/>Un Efesoone yelide wode Phawuloosa Phirisqilan Aqiilan ize ashshida. Yezin faas Ayhude woosa keetstsa gelii Ayhuduntsara ohinttida. <verse eid="ACT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20"/>Un faara gaama wode bettode gaar Phawuloosa woossida yezin E ixxida. <verse eid="ACT 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21"/>Unttappa shaakkinttiter; «Xoozii gayko yinttago maaqqii yo7oda» yaga7i Efesooneppa markkabera qitida. <verse eid="ACT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22"/>Qisaariya yellide wode Yerusalaame hyanggi woosa keetstsa asuntsana saritstsidannippa suuba Anxookiya qitida.<verse eid="ACT 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23"/>Ize eeratsi wode gam77idannippa suuba ammanize asuntsana ubba mintsitsitera Galaatiyaran Phirggeran aadhida.<verse eid="ACT 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aphiloosa Efesoonen Qoronttoosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24"/>Iskkinddiriya yelinttide fettii Aphiloosa gaaze Ayhude asi Efesoone qitida. E ohe erize asin Xoozze qaala gaama erize asi. <verse eid="ACT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25"/>E Laatstsii ogito tamaarii, ayyaanara eexii Yesuusa baz luule tamaarssane. Maaqqo yezin, Wahannisa xinqqate xalaala erane. <verse eid="ACT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26"/>E Ayhude woosa Keetstsite zhashtikaayzara tamaarssane. Phirisqilan Aqiilan E ohizanno si7ide wode eza faara kara kanggi Xoozze ogito tiinositippa geeshi ees ohida.<verse eid="ACT 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27"/>Aphiloosa Akkaya qitodes koyin Efesoone yeze ammanize asuntsi E qoftto ekkii Akkaya yeze ammanzuntsi eza mokkode gaar unttis dabddaabbe xaafida. E ize yelide wode Xoozze aadho keehatitsiti baggara Yesuus Kiristtoosa ammaniduntsana gaama maaddida. <verse eid="ACT 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28"/>Akkos gayko, Yesuusa E Kiristtoosa maaqqizanno Ayhuduntsis Xoozze qaalappa qonccizi asunts tiino mintsii ohi unttana latstsida.<verse eid="ACT 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Efesoone qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1"/>Aphiloosa Qoronttoosa yessadera, Phawuloosa wookka zalara aadhii Efesoone qitida. Izen fettii fettii ammanze asuntsana denggida. <verse eid="ACT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2"/>Unttago, «Yin ammanide wode Geeshi Ayyaana ekkidate?» ga7i oocida.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Un, «Ade, ekkikaaya; melle atto yezin, Geeshi Ayyaana yezannon si7ikaaya» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3"/>Phawuloosa unttago, «Yeezin, akkor xammaqinttidote?» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Un, «Nuunii Wahannisa xinqate xammaqinttida» ga7i mahida.<verse eid="ACT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4"/>Phawuloosa, «Wahannisa faappa suubar ye7ize Yesuus ammanode gaar asuntsis ohiter, nagarappa maaqqes koshshize xinqate xammaqinttida» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Maato. 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mar. 1:4</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:7-8">7-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luqa. 3:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16">16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:26-27">Waha. 1:26-27</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5"/>Un yinno si7ide wode Laatstse Yesuusa tamaare maaqqades xammaqinttida. <verse eid="ACT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6"/>Phawuloosa fa kushito unttalla gaddize wode Geeshi Ayyaana unttalla wodhdhin, melle melle doonara wolla ohinttida; mahi tinbbite ohida. <verse eid="ACT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7"/>Yinna besite taphpho lam77i maaqqize asuntsi yene.<verse eid="ACT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8"/>Phawuloosa Ayhude woosa Keetstsa gelii, Xoozze ka7itumo baz zhashtikaayzara markkidhiter loytsii qoncciziter unttara hyaydzdzii agina yellodes gam7ida. <verse eid="ACT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9"/>Yezin unttappa fete fete dhube maaqqii gaama asunts tiino Laatstse ogito cazhi ammananxii ixxida. Phawuloosa ammanzuntsana unttappa shagii ekkii Xiranoosa gaaze timirtte keetstsa ubba wode unttana tamaarssida. <verse eid="ACT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10"/>Phawuloosa lam77i bere yellodes qaala ohida. Yinnii gisho, Isiya yeze asuntsi ubba, Ayhuduntsin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi Laatstse qaala si7ida.<verse eid="ACT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoozii Phawuloosa kushite oochchide kille baz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11"/>Xoozii Phawuloosa kushite damma kille baz oochchida. <verse eid="ACT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12"/>Yinnii gisho, asuntsi E gallito bochchide maarabito woy ma7ito hyargganchchuntsis kanggane. Unttin faxane; tuna ayyaanuntsin unttappa kezane.<verse eid="ACT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13"/>Tuna ayyaana kessitera wutize Ayhuduntsappa fete fete, «Phawuloosa sabbakize Yesuusa suntsite kezote ga7i yinttana kiittane» ga7i, tuna ayyaana aykkide asuntsalla Laatstse Yesuusa suntsito xeegida <verse eid="ACT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14"/>Ayhude maaqqide Kahinunts hyalaqappa fettii Asqeewe gaaze atstses yinno oochchize laappun dhiiratsi na7unts yene.<verse eid="ACT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15"/>Yezin tuna ayyaanze unttago, «Taanii Yesuusan erane Phawuloosa bazin erane, yezin yin oode?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16"/>Tuna ayyaanze aykkide atstse unttalla doollii wodhdhi, unttana hyarggizi, yinna keetsitippa kallo woxxi dhabode wontsis wolqqidhdhida. <verse eid="ACT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17"/>Efesoone yeze Ayhuduntsin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi ubba yinno si7i gaama zhashtida. Laatstsii Yesuusa suntsita gaama bonchchinttida. <verse eid="ACT 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18"/>Ammanzuntsappa gaamuntsi fa oochchide iita oochito buuxitera qoncce ohiter yene. <verse eid="ACT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19"/>Bitizuntsappa gaamuntsi fa maxaafito shiishii as ubba tiino michchida. Yinna maxaafti waagita ichintam mukul shuchchi bira santime<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maatoosa 26:15 bo7ote. </char></note> maaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20"/>Yinnii gaar yi7i Xoozze qaala wolqqar dicciteran dalggitter qitida.<verse eid="ACT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Efesoone katama kachchi denddida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21"/>Yinna folinttidanippa suuba Phawuloosa, «Taanii Yerusalaame qitii maaqqii Roomen hyanggodes beezane» ga7i Maqedooniyaran Akkayaran aadhii Yerusalaame hyanggodes qofa accida. <verse eid="ACT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22"/>Mahi fana maaddizuntsappa lam77untsana Ximotiyoosan Erasxoosa Maqedooniya kiittii, faas Isiya gidda eerats wode gam7ida.<verse eid="ACT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23"/>Ye wode Laatstse ogiti gisho Efesoone gidda damma kachchi kezida. <verse eid="ACT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24"/>Fettii bira qoxxize Dimexiroosa gaaze atstse Arxemiisa eeqa keetstsa misile birappa medhdhii gaama tirfe dinggizanne. <verse eid="ACT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25"/>Yinnii gisho, yinnii fana oocha oochchizuntsana fettilla shiishii, «Asuntso, nu duretitsita hyanna oochite maaqqidanno yin erane. <verse eid="ACT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26"/>Hyay Phawuloosa, ‹As kushe medhinttide eequntsana baane› ga7i, Efesoonen eeratsi sa7ap attin kumutsi Isiya ubba yeze gaama asuntsana ohi ammantsidannon balitsidannon yin bi7ida si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27"/>Madha maaqqidanna, nu oochita leqqinttizanno xalaala maaqqikaayzin Isiya sa7a ubba yeze asi goynize damma eeqa Arxemiisa keetsita bonchchinttikaayzar attodanna I dammatitsita gol7odanno» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28"/>Asuntsi yinno si7eze wode zhilidhdhi, «Efesoone Arxemiisa damma» ga7i uukkida.<figure style="fig" alt="Goddess Diana or Artemis of the Ephesians" file="HK00286B.TIF" size="span" ref="19:28">Efesoone Arxemiiso</figure> <verse eid="ACT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29"/>Yinna uufita katama ubba yellida. Phawuloosara yedhdhize Maqedooniya asuntsana, Gaayoosan Arsxirokoosan aykkii gochchiter kaa7ize bessa woxxida. <verse eid="ACT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30"/>Phawuloosan asuntsi shiiqide besite gelodes koyda, yezin ammanzuntsi eza kayda. <verse eid="ACT 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31"/>Isiya sa7a hyalaquntsappa Phawuloosa lagge maaqqide fete fete Phawuloosago kiittii, «Kaasi besite qoncce kezii benttippe» ga7i eza woossida.<verse eid="ACT 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32"/>Shiiqide asuntsi hyanodebaz dhabida; gaanggize bagga asuntsi melle atto yezin akkos shiiqezako eroosse gisho fete fettibazis uukkize wode hyankkay mellebazis uukkane. <verse eid="ACT 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33"/>Ayhuduntsi Iskkinddire gaaze atstsa aatsii beezin, fettii fettii asuntsi E gawude baz ohi eza tiino aatsida. E asuntsi si77i gawude gaar fa kushite mallii beezi, asuntsis mootinttodes eqqida. <verse eid="ACT 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34"/>Yezin Iskkinddire Ayhude asi maaqqidanno asuntsi eride wode lam77i saate maaqqade gaar ubbuntsi fettii qaalara, «Efesoone Arxemiise damma» ga7i uukkida.<verse eid="ACT 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35"/>Wurssutsite Katama xaafize asuntsana si77i yiizii, «Efesoone asuntso! Efesoone katama damma Arxemiise eeqa keetstsin saloppa wodhdhide damma shuchchiza naagizanno eroosse asi baaya. <verse eid="ACT 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36"/>Hyanno kaddize asi baayze gisho yin si77i ga7odesin ellisii akko baz yiizaanxxi ashshodes beezane. <verse eid="ACT 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37"/>Yin hyantsi asuntsana, eeqa keetstsa bira kaystikaayzuntsanan nu Xoozza cazikaayzuntsana ki7i. <verse eid="ACT 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38"/>Yinnii gisho, Dimexiroosan eera yeze oochchize asuntsi mootodes oona koyzako, firdda keetsita bugutsi yene; daynnuntsin yene; un mootodes dandda7ane. <verse eid="ACT 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39"/>Yezin yin melle ohe koyko, Shanggo shiiqite ohita bi7intto. <verse eid="ACT 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40"/>Yinno maaqqanxiko hyayno hyanide bazis Roome ka7itumtta nuna oocoda. Hyanna buqutsitis miknaate baayze gisho nu mikinaato ohodes dandda7oos» <verse eid="ACT 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41"/>yaga7i shiiqito lalida.<verse eid="ACT 19:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Maqedoonan Giriken qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1"/>Uukita si7i gaydannippa suuba Phawuloosa ammanze asuntsana xeegizi unttana zorii mintsitsidannippa suuba saritstsi Maqedoona qitodes kezida. <verse eid="ACT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2"/>E aadhize sa7a yeze ammanze asuntsis qaala ohi mintsitsidannippa suuba Girike sa7a qitida. <verse eid="ACT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3"/>E ize hyaydzdzii agina bettii, markkabera Sooriya qitodes qoppii yezin, Ayhuduntsi fana wodhodes koyizanno erii Maqedooniyara suub maaqqades koyda.<verse eid="ACT 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4"/>Phawuloosa moyziduntsi Beeriyappa Pharhuusa na7aya Sophaxiroosa, Teselonqeppa Arsxirokoosan Sikondduusa, Derbbeppa Gaayoosa, Iisiyappa Tikiqoosa, Xirofimoosan Ximotiyoosan. <verse eid="ACT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5"/>Hyantses tiino hyanggi nuna Xiro7aadalla kafane. <verse eid="ACT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6"/>Nu Boora Ba7ale bonchchidannippa suuba Filphisiyusappa markkabera denddii, ichchintsa qammara unttana Xiro7aada yellii ize laappun qamma gam77ida.<verse eid="ACT 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Xiro7aadalla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7"/>Saaminttappa tiino qamma nu boora baxxodes shiiqii yezin, Phawuloosa wonttistto qitodes qoppide gisho unttis qaala ohitera giddii bilahe yellodes ohito gam7izida. <verse eid="ACT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8"/>Nu shiiqii bettide fooqite gaama foo7o yene. <verse eid="ACT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9"/>Ewuxikoosa gaaze fettii yidhdhize maskkootella bettii, fana botii genttida. Phawuloosa ohito pharggizide wode Ewuxikoosa gentti hyaydzdzintsa fooqizeppa gol7i hyayqqezin asuntsi dentsida. <verse eid="ACT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10"/>Yezin Phawuloosa wodhdhii, eella zuggida. Eza iringgi, «E hyayqqikaaya, tannippete» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11"/>Yinnippa suuba, ude fooqella kezii boora baxxi mu7ida. Sa7a wonttode wontsis asuntsis ohidannippa suuba denddii qitida. <verse eid="ACT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12"/>Ye faxide yidhdhiza kara kanggi gaama ufayttida.<verse eid="ACT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Xiro7aadappa Miliixe qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13"/>Yezin Phawuloosa fana izippa mokkode gaar nuus ohide gisho tiinidhii markkabego hyanggi, Asoosa qitodes denddida. Akkos gayko, E tohera qitodes qoppide gisho nuna hyannii gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14"/>E nuura Asoosa yellinttin markkabera eza ekkii Mixiliine hyanggida. <verse eid="ACT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15"/>Wonttistti wode izippa denddii markkabera Kiyoosa tiino yeze besite yellida; mahi wonttistti wode Saamosa fiinggi kaallize wodite Miliixe yellida. <verse eid="ACT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16"/>Phawuloosa Isiya gidda gaama gami7ikaayzara Efesoone kalera aadhodes qoppida. Faas dandda7inttiko Phenxeqosxe Ba7ale wode Yerusalaame yellodes ellisane.<verse eid="ACT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Efesoone cimmuntsan zorida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17"/>Phawuloosa Miliixeppa Efesoone kiittii woosa keetstsa cimuntsana xeegizida. <verse eid="ACT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18"/>Woosa keetstsa cimuntsi eego yi7in, unttago hyannigaara yagayda: «Taanii Isiya gelide tiino qammitippa aykkii yinttara yezide wode ubba wayzi yezezako yin erane. <verse eid="ACT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19"/>Ayhuduntsi shiiqii taalla madha yeltsikon ta ashkketitsaran gaama afutstsara Laatstsis oochchida. <verse eid="ACT 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20"/>Bucan yin keetsite keetsite yinttana tamaarssittera yinttana maaddize bazappa fettibazin faccizikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21"/>Taanii Ayhuduntsisin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsis nagarappa Xoozago maaqqade gaaran nu Laatstse Yesuusa ammanode gaar markkidhida.<verse eid="ACT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22"/>«Ize tana akko yellode yezako eroos, yezin hyatte taanii Geeshi Ayyaanas kiitinttii Yerusalaame qitane. <verse eid="ACT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23"/>Yinno maaqqikon Geeshi Ayyaana katama ubba achchin madhan tana naagizanno taas markkidhida. <verse eid="ACT 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24"/>Yezin ta wotsito folodes Laatstse Yesuusap ekkide oochito, Xoozze aadho keehatitsi Wonggele markkidhizanno folodes ta shemppito fatstsoosse baz fana faydane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Ximo. 4:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25"/>«Taanii hyatten Xoozze ka7itumo markkidhitera yin gidda wutida. Yikkeppa suuba yinttappa ooden tana be7aamanno erane. <verse eid="ACT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26"/>Yinnii gisho, yinttappa fettii asi dhabikon ta oocinttaamanno hyayno qamma yinttis geeshi ohine. <verse eid="ACT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27"/>Akkos gayko, Xoozze qofa ubba yinttis akko bazin ashshikaayzara ohida.<verse eid="ACT 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28"/>«Fa na7ay suutsite wonggide Xoozze woosa keetsito naagote. Geeshi Ayyaana yinttana yenggizuntsana mahi dooride wuditisin yin ommitisin naaginttote. <verse eid="ACT 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29"/>Taanii hyanggidannippa suuba, wuditis yiqsinttoosse iita suudhumuntsi yin gidda gelodanno ta erane. <verse eid="ACT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30"/>Tamaaruntsana fa suub kaalitsodes worddo tamaarssize asuntsi yin giddappa denddoda. <verse eid="ACT 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31"/>Yinnii gisho, ta hyaydzdzii bere qamman awaran afutstsara yinttana ommite ommite kaccidanno qoppitter minggote.<verse eid="ACT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32"/>«Hyatten yinttana mintsodesin geeshi asuntsara laata immades dandda7ize Xoozzesin E aadho keehatitsi qaalas yinttana hyadara inggane.<verse eid="ACT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33"/>«Taanii oodeppan bira woy worqqa woy afula ekkikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34"/>Taanii ta kushite oochchii taasin taara yezuntsana beezzebaz maaddidanno yin, yin ommite erane. <verse eid="ACT 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35"/>Yin hyannifana labbii oochitera labbiduntsana maaddodannon Laatstsii Yesuusa, ‹Ekkizeppa aadhii inggizay anjjinttidaya› gayde qaaltto yin qoppodes beezanno ta yinttana ubbabazite beezida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 20:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36"/>Phawuloosa yinno ohi hyaasii un ubbuntsara bunqqunttii Xooz woossida. <verse eid="ACT 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37"/>Un ubbuntsi Phawuloosa iringgi yeekkii yeerida. <verse eid="ACT 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38"/>E Mahi, «Tana be7aama» yagayde qaaltta unttana gaama azzantsida. Un markkabe yellodes eza moyzida.<verse eid="ACT 20:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Yerusalaame qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1"/>Nu Efesoone cimuntsappa shaginttideppa suuba markkabera Qoose qitida. Wonttistti wode Rooda yellii izippa Phaxira qitida. <verse eid="ACT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2"/>Fenqqe fiinggize markkabe denggi E gidda gelii qitodes denddida. <verse eid="ACT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3"/>Nu Qoophiroosa bi7ide wode, Qoophiroosa workkita bagga ashshii Sooriya yedhdhida. Markkabize fa caantto ize ketstsodes koyde gisho Xiroosa qitida. <verse eid="ACT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4"/>Ize ammanze asuntsana denggi unttara laappun qamma bettida. Phawuloosa Yerusalaame qitaame gaar un ees Ayyaanara ohida. <verse eid="ACT 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5"/>Nuunii un kale gam7ize wodita hyal7in kezii qitida. Un ubba fa machchuntsaran fa na7untsara wolla katamappa gaxa kessii nuna moyzida. Nu abba kale bunqqunttii Xooz woossida. <verse eid="ACT 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6"/>Yinnippa suuba, wol sarotsin nu markkabite gelida; un fa kara maaqqida.<verse eid="ACT 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7"/>Nu abba ogito hyaasii, Xiroosappa Phexelemaysa yellida. Ize ammanze asuntsana saritstsi, un kale fettii qamma feezhida. <verse eid="ACT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8"/>Wonttistti wode kezii, Qisaariya qitida. Sabaake Filphoosa kara yellii E kale bettida. E Yerusalaame tiino doorinttide laappuntsafa feta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5">Hawa. 6:5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9"/>Filphoosas nabe maaqqide oyddii wudur na7untsi yene.<verse eid="ACT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10"/>Nuunii unddenna qamma ize bettezin Agaboosa gaaze nabe Yihudappa Qisaariya yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:28">Hawa. 11:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11"/>Nuugo yi7i Phawuloosa saqqe ekkii nabize fa kushiton fa tohito accii, «Geeshi Ayyaana hyay saqqize adaya, Yerusalaame Ayhuduntsi hyannigaara accii, Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsis aatsii inggoda gaane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12"/>Nuunii yinno si7ide wode nuunin yeze asuntsi Phawuloosa Yerusalaame qitaame gaar woossida. <verse eid="ACT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13"/>Yezin Phawuloosa mahi, «Yin hyannigaara yeekkitera akkos ta wozintto tannize? Taanii, Laatstse Yesuusa suntsiti gisho acintte xalaala maaqqikaayzin Yerusalaame hyayqqodesin giiginttida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14"/>Nu zoridanno E ekkanxi ixxin, «Laatstse qofita hyano» ga7i si77i gayda.<verse eid="ACT 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15"/>Ize eeratsi wode gam77idannippa suuba giiginttii Yerusalaame qitodes kezida. <verse eid="ACT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16"/>Qisaariya yeze ammanze asuntsappa eeratsuntsi nuura hyanggida. Un nuunii shemppode bessi Minaasone gaaze Qoophiroosa atstse kara kaalitsida. Minaasone tiino ammanide asuntsappa feta.<verse eid="ACT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Yerusalaame Yayqooba yellida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17"/>Nuunii Yerusalaame yellide wode ammanze asuntsi nuna ufaytti mokkida. <verse eid="ACT 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18"/>Wonttistti wode Phawuloosan nuunii Yayqoobara yellinttodes qitida. Woosa keetstsa cimuntsi ubbuntsi ize yene. <verse eid="ACT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19"/>Phawuloosa unttana saritstsidannippa suuba Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts gidda fa baggara Xoozii oochchidanno ubba unttis ohida.<verse eid="ACT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20"/>Un yinno si7ide wode Xooz galatii Phawuloosago hyannigaara yagayda: «Nu ishayo, Ayhuduntsi gidda wantsi mukuluntsi Xooz ammanezako ne be7ine; un ubbuntsin higge mintsii naagane. <verse eid="ACT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21"/>Neenii Ayhude maaqqoosuntsana sa7a yeze Ayhude ubba fa na7untsi garrazinttaame gaar, Ayhuduntsi woga kaallaame gaaran Muse higge ixxode gaar neenii tamaarssizanno Yerusalaame yeze Ayhuduntsi si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22"/>Yeezin akko lo77o? Ne yi7idanno turo si7oda.<verse eid="ACT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23"/>«Yinnii gisho, nuunii nees ohizanno si7o; gefa yeze oyddii asuntsi nu kale yene.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23-24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:13-21">Faydo 6:13-21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24"/>Unttana ekkii unttara geezho; mahi un fa ommito meedinttode gaar unttis miishe inggo. Un zaga nebaz si7idanna turo maaqqikaayzannon neenii ne ommiten higge naagize asi maaqqidanno ubbuntsi erane.<verse eid="ACT 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25"/>«Yezin ammanze Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsana maaqqizako, un eeqas zharshinttidebaz ma7aame gaar, suutsi uzhaame gaar, bawuta ma7aame gaaran olalaame gaar, nuunii ohito accii, firddi unttis kiita xaafida» gayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">Hawa. 15:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26"/>Yinnippa suuba, Phawuloosa wonttistti wode asuntsana ekkii, unttara geezhida. E fa geezhe wodita ayde folinttode yezako erisodesin fa zharshito ayde zharshode yezako erisodes Xoozze keetstsa gelida.<verse eid="ACT 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa aykinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27"/>Laappun qamma folinttodes ukkodera, Iisiyappa yi7ide Ayhuduntsi Xoozze Keetstsa Phawuloosa bi7i, as ubba dentsitsii Phawuloosa aykkida. <verse eid="ACT 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28"/>«Isra7eele asuntso, nuna maaddote; hyay atstse, nu worzhito, nu higgiton hyanna Xoozze Keetsito ixxode gaar as ubbuntsana ubba bessa tamaarssane. Yinnan maaqqaanxi ixxin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsana Xoozze keetstsa gelitsii, hyanna geeshi bessito tunizida» yaga7i uukkida. <verse eid="ACT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29"/>Un yinno gaydanna zaga Efesoone Xirofimoosa Phawuloosara katama bi7ide gisho hyatte Phawuloosa Xoozze keetstsa eza ekkii gelidebaz unttis aazida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Hawa. 20:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30"/>Katamita ubba buqinttida; asuntsi ubba shiiqii Phawuloosa aykkii Xoozze keetstsappa bale gochchida. Xoozze Keetstsa furtsita ellisii gorddinttida. <verse eid="ACT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31"/>Asuntsi Phawuloosa wodhodes yi7adera, «Yerusalaame katama kumutsi buqinttida» gaaze wortta Roome shaalaqago yellida. <verse eid="ACT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32"/>Shaalaqize wottaddaruntsanan mato hyalaquntsana ekkii woxxittera yi7ida. Asuntsi shaalaqizan wottaddaruntsana bi7ide wode Phawuloosa guuddizanno ashshida.<verse eid="ACT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33"/>Ye wode shaalaqize shiiqii, Phawuloosa aykkii, lam77i santsalaatara acinttode gaar kiittida. Yeyzi, E oona yezakon akko oochchezako asuntsana oocida. <verse eid="ACT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34"/>Asuntsappa baggita fettibaz ga7i uukkize wode hyankuntsi mellebaz ga7i uukkane. Uukita gaanggide gisho shaalaqize turtto shagodes dandda7inttaanxin, wottaddaruntsi Phawuloosa fa yeze bessa kanggode gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35"/>Phawuloosa yedhdhii kezize darajjito yellize wode asuntsi urqqizanni gisho wottaddaruntsi eza tookkida. <verse eid="ACT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36"/>Gaama asuntsi, «E hyayqqo!» ga7i uukkitera kaallane.<verse eid="ACT 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa moottis mahe inggida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37"/>Wottaddaruntsi Phawuloosa fa yeze bessito geltsodes yi7adera, Phawuloosa shaalaqizego, «Taanii nees fettibaz ohiko si7odate?» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">E Phawuloosago, «Ne Girike doona erane? <verse eid="ACT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38"/>Neenii hyannippa tiino buqutsi medhdhii shemppo wodhide oyddii mukul asuntsana ekkii akko baayze ganas gelide Gibxxe atstsa baane?» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 21:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39"/>Yezin Phawuloosa, «Taanii, Kilqiya yeze erinttide Terseese katama asi maaqqide Ayhude asi. Tana asuntsis ohizoya?» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40"/>Shaalaqize eego, «Oho» ga7in Phawuloosa darajjalla eqqii, asuntsi si77i gawude gaar fa kushtira mallida. Asuntsi si77i ga7in Ibraysxe doonara hyannigaara gayda:<verse eid="ACT 21:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1"/>«Ta ishuntson, ta aduntso, taanii hyatte yinttis inggize mahito si7ote.» <verse eid="ACT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2"/>Phawuloosa unttis Ibraysxe doonara ohizanna si7i kasennippa aatsii si77i gayda. E kaallii,<verse eid="ACT 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3"/>«Taanii Kilqiya yeze Terseese yelintti hyanna katamtte diccida. Ta asttamaarizen Gamaaliyale; taanii nu aaduntsi higgito mintsii tamaarida, hyayno yin ubba hyanizannigaara Xoozis mishinttize Ayhude asi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34-39">Hawa. 5:34-39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4"/>Ta hyanna ogito kaallize maachuntsanan dhiiratsunsana aykkii achi keetstsa oliteran unttana wodhissade wontsis madha beezze asi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5"/>Yinnii gaara, kahinunts hyalaqizen Shanggo ubba ta baz markkidhades dandda7ane. Taanii Damasqqo yeze un ishuntsis unttappa dabddaabbe ekkii ize yeze asuntsi acinttii seerinttode gaar Yerusalaame unttana ko7odes ize qitida.<verse eid="ACT 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6"/>«Ta hyanggi Damasqqo ukkide wode awara saate qoppikaayzin saloppa damma foo7o ta kantto wutii foo7ida. <verse eid="ACT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7"/>Ta sa7ite gol7i yessadera, ‹Saawula, Saawula, tana akkos baytstse?› gaaze qaala si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8"/>Taanii mahi, ‹Laatstso, neenii oode?› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:8">«E mahi, Taanii, ne baytsize Naazirete Yesuusa» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9"/>Taara yezuntsi foo7ito bi7idap attin taas ohize qaaltto si7ikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10"/>«Taanii, ‹Laatstso, ta akko oochcho?› yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">«Laatstsi taago, ‹Denddii Damasqqo qito. Ne oochchode gaar Xoozii qoppidebaz ubba ize nees ohinttoda› yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11"/>Yinna damma foo7itippa denddii ta aafita dhumin, taara yeze asuntsi ta kushito aykkii, tana gochchii Damasqqo yeltstsida.<verse eid="ACT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12"/>«Damasqqo yeze Ayhuduntsi ubba markkidhezen gaama bonchchize fettii Hananiya gaaze atstse, nu higgito bonchchizen Xooz mintsii woossize yene. <verse eid="ACT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13"/>E taago yi7i, ta kale eqqii, ‹Ta ishe Saawula, bo7o› gayda. Ellisii ta eza bi7ida.<verse eid="ACT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14"/>«E taago, ‹Nu aaduntsi Xoozze neenii E qoftto erode gaar, Xilliza be7ade gaaran E doonttippa qaala si7ade gaar tiinii nena doorida. <verse eid="ACT 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15"/>Neenii bi7idebazisin si7idebaz as ubba tiino ees markka maaqqade fana. <verse eid="ACT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16"/>Hyatte akkos gam77e? Xammaqintto; E suntsito xeegii ne nagarttippa meecintto› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17"/>«Taanii suuba Yerusalaame maaqqii Xoozze Keetstsa woossodera, taas qonccitsi benttida. <verse eid="ACT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18"/>Qonccisite Laatstsii taago, ‹Ne taas markkidhize markkatitsito asuntsi ekkoosse gisho ellisii Yerusalaameppa kezo› yaga7odera bi7ida.<verse eid="ACT 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19"/>«Taanii, ‹Laatstso, Ayhude woosa Keetstsa ubba nena ammanzuntsana aykkii hyadhdhidayan achi keetstsa olidaya maaqqizanno un erane. <verse eid="ACT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20"/>Un ne markka Isxifaanosa wodhize wode ta yinna oochchite wolla yene. Mahi un kale eqqii eza wodhizunts ma7ito naagane› yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58">Hawa. 7:58</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21"/>«Laatstsii taago, ‹Taanii nena Ayhude maaqqoosse asuntsago hyaako sa7a kiittode gisho denddii qito› » yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Roome asi maaqqizanno ersida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22"/>Phawuloosa yinna qaaltto ohi hyaasode wontsis asuntsi E gaazanno si7ine. Yinnippa suuba, fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Hyanna sa7itippa dhabiso! E yessades beezoos» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23"/>Un kacinttii, fa ma7ito eella afa dhogii xura ude lalodera; <verse eid="ACT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24"/>Shaalaqize bi7i wottaddaruntsi Phawuloosa un fa yeze bessa kanggode gaara kiitida. Mahi asuntsi akkos hyannigaara kacinttezako erodes koyi Phawuloosa dafera garafii loytsii oocode gaar unttana kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25"/>Yezin wottaddaruntsi Phawuloosa dafera mintsii accii garafodes yiize wode Phawuloosa fa kantte eqqide mato hyalaqizego, «Roome asi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Roome asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">16:37 Bo7ote. </char></note> firdda baayzin garafizanna yinttis woga?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26"/>Mato hyalaqize yinno si7ide wode shaalaqizego hyanggi, «Hyay atstse Roome asi. Neenii akko oochchodes qoppe?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27"/>Shaalaqize Phawuloosago shiiqii, «Ne Roome aso? Ane taas oho» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Phawuloosa, «Yee» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28"/>Shaalaqize mahi, «Taanii hyanno gadetitsito gaama miishera ekkida» yagayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Yezin Phawuloosa, «Ta hyanna gadetitsito yelintti ekkida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29"/>Yinnii gisho, Phawuloosa loytsii oocodes qoppiduntsi iira eeppa shaakkinttida. Shaalaqize Roome asi santsalaatara accidanno eride wode zhashtida.<verse eid="ACT 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Ayhude Shanggo tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30"/>Wonttisti wode Shaalaqize, Ayhuduntsi Phawuloosa akkos mootezako shaakkii erodes koyi billida. Kahinunts hyalaquntsin shanggo ubbuntsi shiiqode gaar kiittida; mahi Phawuloosa ki7i un tiino essida.<verse eid="ACT 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1"/>Phawuloosa firddize asuntsana dakkii bi7i, «Ta ishuntso, ta hyayno yellodes Xoozze tiino ta yestte ubba lo77o wozinara yezida» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2"/>Kahinunts hyalaqize Hananiya, Phawuloosa doontto baqqode gaar E kale eqqiduntsana kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3"/>Ye wode Phawuloosa eego, «Naate bootsi forchcho tizhinttide dochey, Xoozii nena baqqoda. Neenii taalla higgera firddodes bettii yezite higge ashshii tana baqqade gaar kiittane?» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27-28">Maato. 23:27-28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4"/>Phawuloosa kale eqqiduntsi eego, «Ne Xoozze kahinunts hyalaqa cazhane?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5"/>Phawuloosa, «Ta ishuntso, E kahinunts hyalaqa maaqqidanno ta erikaaya; akkos gayko Xoozze qaaltte, ‹Ne worzha ahizella iita qaala ohippe› yaga7intti xaafinttida» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Keze 22:28</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6"/>Yezin Phawuloosa yinna besite yeze asuntsappa bagguntsi Saduqaawuyane, bagguntsi Farisaawuyane maaqqizanno erii, «Ta ishuntso, ta Farisaawuyane Farisaawuyane na7a; ‹Hyayqqiduntsi hyayqoppa denddoda› ga7i taanii ufayssara naagize gisho un taalla firddane» yaga7i ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:5">Hawa. 26:5</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filph. 3:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7"/>Phawuloosa yinno gayde wode Farisaawunts giddan Saduqaawuntsi gidda kachchi kezin shaakkinttida. <verse eid="ACT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8"/>Akkos gayko, Saduqaawuntsi, «Hyayqqide asi denddoos; kiitanchchon, ayyaanan baaya» yagaazuntsana. Yezin Farisaawuntsi ubba yezanno ammanane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Maato. 22:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18">Mar. 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luqa. 20:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9"/>Damma kachchi kezida; Farisaawunts zala maaqqide higge asttamaaruntsi denddii eqqii, «Hyay atstsella akko bala baz denggikaaya; ees ayyaana woy kiitanchcho ohikaayzara ashshoos» yaga7i wolla lallida.<verse eid="ACT 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10"/>Kachchita ganggin asuntsi Phawuloosa shaqitsi ekkaame gaar ga7i, shaalaqize fa wottaddaruntsi wodhdhii un gidda fa eza ellisii kessii fa yeze bessa kanggode gaar kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11"/>Yinnii qamma Laatstsii Phawuloosa kale eqqii, «Phawuloosa, ne taas Yerusalaame markkidhidanni fana Roomen markkidhades beezane; minggo; akko baaya» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa wodhodes zorinttida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12"/>Wonttisti wode Ayhuduntsi, «Phawuloosa wodhikaayzara mo7oos uzhoos» ga7i caaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13"/>Phawuloosalla yinno zorintti caaqqide asuntsi oytamappa aadhane. <verse eid="ACT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14"/>Un kahinunts hyalaquntsi gade cimuntsago hyanggi, «Nuunii Phawuloosa wodhikaayzara katstsa gaazebaz mo7oos ga7i caaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15"/>Yikke, yinttin shangguntsin E baz loytsii qurichchizebaz yeze baz mahi, Phawuloosa yinttago ko7ode gaar shaalaqiza oocote. Nuunii E hyanna shiiqita yellodannippa tiino eza wodhodes giigii bettida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16"/>Yezin Phawuloosa mishti na7ay yinna zorinttidanno si7i hyanggi wottaddaruntsi yeze bessito gelii, Phawuloosas ohida. <verse eid="ACT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17"/>Phawuloosa mato hyalaquntsappa feta xeegii, «Hyay na7aya shaalaqizes ohize baz yeze gisho eza shaalaqizego kanggo» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18"/>Mato hyalaqize na7aya shaalaqizego kanggi, «Achi keetstsa yeze Phawuloosa tana faago xeegii, hyay na7ay nees ohize baz yeze gisho eza neego ko7ode gaar tana woossida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19"/>Shaalaqize na7ay kushito aykkii, bale kessii, «Ne taas ohode qoftta akko?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20"/>Na7ay shaalaqizego, «Ayhuduntsi Phawuloosabaz tiinoppan miintsii qurichchodes koyze gaar aazin neenii wontta eza shiiqite ko7ode gaar nena woossodes zore accida. <verse eid="ACT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21"/>Yezin neenii un gaazanno si7ippe. Akkos gayko, oytamappa aadhize asuntsi Phawuloosa wodhikaayzara ‹Katstsa mo7oos, hyaatsi uzhoos› ga7i caaqqii, aachintti eza kafane. Hyatte ne gaazebaz xalaala si7odes kafane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22"/>Shaalaqize mahi, «Hyanna ohito ne taas ohidanno melle oodesin ohippe» yaga7i na7aya suub dakkida.<verse eid="ACT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa worzha ahize Filkkisa tiino kiittida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23"/>Shaalaqize mato hyalaquntsappa lam77untsana xeegii, «Qammappa hyaydzdzii saate Qisaariya qitodes, lam77i xeet wottaddaruntsana, laappun tam faara asuntsanan lam77i xeet toora woringgizuntsana giigizote. <verse eid="ACT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24"/>Gadito ahize Filkkisago Phawuloosa saro yelitsodes toggize faara giigizote» yaga7i unttana kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25"/>Shaalaqize Filkkisas hyannigaara gaaze dabddaabbe xaafida:<verse eid="ACT 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26"/>«Qalawudiyoosa Luusiyosappa gade ahize bonchcho Filkkisasa, saro nees maaqqe. <verse eid="ACT 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27"/>Ayhuduntsi hyay atstsa aykkii wodhodes yi7adera, E Roome sa7a asi maaqqidanno erii wottaddaruntsara yellii eza ashshida. <verse eid="ACT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28"/>Un eza akkos mootizako erodes koyi un shiiqite eza ta shiishida. <verse eid="ACT 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29"/>Un fa higgitis eza mootidap attin eza wodhizebaz woy accizebaz baayzanno ta denggida. <verse eid="ACT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30"/>Un hyay atstsella zorinttide zigirsita tana yellin, ta ellisii eza neego dakkida. Eza mootizuntsi ne tiino hyanggi mootode gaar kiittida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31"/>Yinnii gisho, wottaddaruntsi kiitinttidanni fana Phawuloosa ekkii, qamma Antiphaxirisa yeltsida. <verse eid="ACT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32"/>Wonttisti wode faara asuntsi eera hyanggode gaar yeyizi asuntsi suub maaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33"/>Toggiduntsi Qisaariya yellii dabddaabbiza gade ahizes inggi, Phawuloosa E tiino aatsida. <verse eid="ACT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34"/>Gade ahizay dabddaabbiza nabbabidannippa maaqqii «Phawuloosa, ne aba gade aso?» ga7i eza oocida. E Kilqiya asi maaqqidanno eride wode <verse eid="ACT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35"/>«Taanii nebaz nena mootizuntsi yi7ide wode si7oda» yagayda. Wottaddaruntsi Phawuloosa Heroodisa gibbe naagode gaar kiittida.<verse eid="ACT 23:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Ayhuduntsi mootida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1"/>Ichchin qammappa suuba kahinunts hyalaqize Hananiya, cimuntsaran Xerxeluusa gaaze fettii xabaqizera Qisaariya qitida. Un gade ahizuntsalla Phawuloosa mootida. <verse eid="ACT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2"/>Phawuloosa xeegintti gelide wode Xerxeluusa eza hyannigaara yaga7i mootida:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">«Bonchcho Filkkisa, nuunii ne baggara gaama saro denggida, ne lo77o ahizanne nu gadita gaama laaminttida. <verse eid="ACT 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3"/>Bonchcho Filkkisa, nuunii aban ayde maaqqin folo galatara yinno ekkane. <verse eid="ACT 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4"/>Taanii nena gam77izikaayzara neenii ne keehatitsite nu baz hyaatara si7ode gaar nena woossane. <verse eid="ACT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5"/>Hyay atstse dhube maaqqii sa7a ubba yeze Ayhudunts gidda buqutsi medhdhii Naazirawunts bagga asuntsana kaalitsizaya maaqqidanno erida. <verse eid="ACT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6"/>Melle atto yezin, Xoozze Keetsito tunissades yi7adera nuunii eza aykkida; [nu higgitigaara ezalla firddodes qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7"/>Yezin shaalaqize Luusiyosa yi7i, wolqqara nu kushtippa eza kessii ekkida. <verse eid="ACT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8"/>Eza mootizuntsin neego ye7ode gaar kiittida]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fettii fettii zaga maxaafite hyay kifilize baaya</char></note>. Neenii ne ommite hyay atstsa qurichchi nuunii eza mootize mootto ubba erodes dandda7ane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9"/>Ayhuduntsin, «Hyanna ohita turo» ga7i E qoftto ma77ida.<verse eid="ACT 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa moottis mahe inggida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10"/>Gade ahizay Phawuloosa oho ga7i mallida. Phawuloosa hyannigaara ga7i mahida: «Neenii gaama wodeppa aykkii, hyantsi asuntsis firdditera yezanno erii ta ohitis ufayssi wodhin mahe inggane. <verse eid="ACT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11"/>Taanii goynodes Yerusalaame kezin taphpho lam77i qammappa aadhosanno neenii ne ommite erodes dandda7ane. <verse eid="ACT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12"/>Ayhuduntsi tana Xoozze Keetstsa maaqqin Ayhuduntsi woosa Keetstsa maaqqin katama maaqqin ooderan lallodera woy as shiishii buqutses dentsitsodera fettii asin denggikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13"/>Hyatten un tana mootize bazitis markka denggodes dandda7oos.<verse eid="ACT 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14"/>«Yezin taanii fettibaz ammanane; taanii higge gidda yezebazin nabuntsi xaafide ubbabazito ammanii, nu aduntsi Xoozza, un worddo timirttite ogite goynane. <verse eid="ACT 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15"/>Un fa ommite ammanizanni gaar xilluntsin nagaranchuntsin hyayqoppa denddodanno taanin ammanane. <verse eid="ACT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16"/>Yinnii gisho, taanii Xoozze tiinon as tiino ubba wode lo77o qofa taas yessade gaar minggane.<verse eid="ACT 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17"/>«Taanii Yerusalaameppa kezidannippa gaama bereppa suuba ta bagga dahuntsis maade immadesin zharsho zharshodes Yerusalaame yi7ida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">Hawa. 21:17-28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18"/>Taanii Xoozze Keetstsite yinno oochchii geezhe woga folii maaqqadera tana denggida. Ye wode taara gaama asi baaya, kachchin kezikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19"/>Yezin Iisiyappa yi7ide fettii fettii Ayhuduntsi ize yene; un taalla ohodes koyko yi7i tana neella mootodes dandda7ane. <verse eid="ACT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20"/>Woy taanii shanggo tiino shiiqide wode oochchide bala yeziko hyantses ne tiino yezuntsi oho. <verse eid="ACT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21"/>Turo taanii un gidda eqqii ‹Hyayqqiduntsi denddo yene ga7i hyayno firddas yin tiino shiiqida› ga7i uukki ohida; yinnippa melle yiizide baz baaya» yagayda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Hawa. 23:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22"/>Yezin Filkkisa Laatstse oge baz shaakkii eride gisho «Taanii yin ohito shaalaqa Luusiyosa yi7ide wode firddoda» ga7i qaxaro inggi dakkida. <verse eid="ACT 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23"/>Filkkisa mahi Phawuloosa accikaayyezara naagode gaaran E iginuntsappa ooden eza oocodes ye7odera kayaame fana mato hyalaqizes ohida.<verse eid="ACT 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Filkkisa tiinon Dirusilla tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24"/>Eeratsi qammappa suuba, Filkkisa Ayhude maaqqide fa machchiti Dirusillara yi7i Phawuloosa kiittii ki7izii Kiristtoos Yesuusa ammano baz eeppa si7ida. <verse eid="ACT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25"/>Phawuloosa xillotitsibaz, fa omma ahizebazin yo7odes yeze firddabaz ohodera, Filkkisa zhashtii, «Ne hyattes qito; taas wottide wode nena xeegisada» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26"/>Ye wode Phawuloosappa gubbo ekkodes qoppii eza mahi mahi xeegizi eera ohinttane.<verse eid="ACT 24:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27"/>Lam77i bereppa suuba, Filkkisa besite Phorqiyoos Fisxoosa shuumunttida. Filkkisa Ayhuduntsana ufayssodes koyi Phawuloosa billikaayzara ashshida.<verse eid="ACT 24:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Roome Kaatizego abeet gayda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1"/>Fisxoosa fa awurajja gelii hyaydzdzii qammappa suuba Qisaariyappa Yerusalaame qitida. <verse eid="ACT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2"/>Ize kahinunts hyalaquntsin Ayhuduntsana kaalitsizuntsi Phawuloosa mootida. <verse eid="ACT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3"/>«Phawuloosa Yerusalaame ki7izii nuus lo77o baz oochchoya» ga7i woossida; yinno un gaydanna Phawuloosa oge naagii eza wodhodes koyde gisho. <verse eid="ACT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4"/>Fisxoosa unttago, «Phawuloosa, Qisaariya achi keetstsa yene; taanii ta ommiten ellisii suuba maaqqades yi7ine. <verse eid="ACT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5"/>E balidebaz yeziko yin shuumuntsi taara Qisaariya wodhdhii eza mooto» yaga7i mahida.<verse eid="ACT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6"/>Fisxoosa un kale osfun woy taphphi qamma gaar gam77idannippa suuba Qisaariya wodhdhida. Wonttisti wode firdda oydalla bettii Phawuloosa ko7ode gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7"/>E yi7in Yerusalaameppa yi7ide Ayhuduntsi E kale eqqii un markka shiishodes dandda7oosse damma mintsi mooto eella shiishida. <verse eid="ACT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8"/>Phawuloosa mahi, «Taanii Ayhuduntsi higge maaqqin Xoozze Keetstsa maaqqin woy Roome Kaat maaqqin Qeesare qohikaaya» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9"/>Yezin Fisxoosa Ayhuduntsana ufayssodes koyi Phawuloosago, «Yerusalaame hyanggi hyanna moottis ize ta tiintte firddinttodes koyane?» yaga7i oocida.<verse eid="ACT 25:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10"/>Yezin Phawuloosa, «Taanii firddinttodes beezize Qeesare firdda keetstsa tiino eqqida. Neenii loytsii erzanni gaar ta Ayhuduntsana akkoran qohikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11"/>Yikke, taanii qohidebazin hyayqos yeltsidebaz oochchidebaz maaqqizako hyayqoppa tana ashsho ga7oos. Yezin un tana mootize mootta cer maaqqiko ooden tana unttis aatsii inggodes dandda7oos. Qeesare ta baz firddo ga7i oocane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12"/>Ye wode Fisxoosa fa zorinttizuntsara zorintti, «Neenii Qeesare ta baz firddo ga7i oocida; Qeesarego qitoda» ga7i mahida.<verse eid="ACT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Agirpha tiinon Barnniiqe tiino shiiqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13"/>Eeratsi qammappa suuba Kaat Agirphan Barnniiqen Fisxoosa saritsodes Qisaariya hyanggida. <verse eid="ACT 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14"/>Ize un gaama wode gam77in, Fisxoosa Kaatizes Phawuloosabaz hyannigaara yaga7i qonccizida; «Filkkisa billikaayzara ashshii qitide fettii atstse hyanne yene. <verse eid="ACT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15"/>Taanii Yerusalaame hyanggide wode kahinunts hyalaquntsin Ayhude cimuntsi eella afa firddode gaar tana woossii E baz taalla mootida. <verse eid="ACT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16"/>Taanii, ‹Mootinttide atstse fana mootizunts tiino eqqii fa mootidannis mahe inggikaayzin, oona maaqqikon aadhii ingginttizanna Roome woga baaya› ga7i unttis mahida.<verse eid="ACT 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17"/>«Yinnii gisho, un hyanne shiiqide wode taanii gami7ikaayzara wonttisiti wode firdda keetstsa gelii Phawuloosa ko7ode gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18"/>Eza mootizuntsi E kale wutii eqqii, iitabazara eza mootikaayzar ashshaama ga7i taanii qoppidanni gaar eza mootikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19"/>Yezin un fa ammanobazin Phawuloosa, ‹Faxa yene› gaaze fettii hyayqqide Yesuusa ga7inttize atstsebaz eera lallane. <verse eid="ACT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20"/>Hyanna ohita tana shaakkodes deexide gisho Phawuloosa Yerusalaame hyanggi, ize firddinttodes koyzako ga7i eza oocida. <verse eid="ACT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21"/>Yezin Phawuloosa fa ohito Qeesare be7ade wontsis achi keetstsa gam7odes oocida. Taanii eza Qeesarego dakkode wontsis E accinttode gaar kiittida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22"/>Yinnii gisho, Agirpha Fisxoosago, «Taanii ta ommiten hyay atstse gaazanno si7odes koyane» gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Fisxoosa eego, «Neenii wontta E gaazanno si7oda» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23"/>Wontistti wode Agirphin Barnniiqen damma bonchchora shaalaquntsara katama yeze ahize asuntsara yi7i firdda keetstsa gelida. Fisxoosa Phawuloosa xeegizi ki7ida. <verse eid="ACT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24"/>Fisxoosa, «Kaati Agirphan, hyanne nuura yeze asuntso, Ayhuduntsi Yerusalaamen hyannen uukki, ‹E yikkeppa suuba faxa yessades beezoos› yaga7i, tana woosside atstsa hyaya yin be7ine. <verse eid="ACT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25"/>Yezin eza hyayqos yeltsizebaz akko bazin taanii denggikaaya. E fa ommite, ‹Qeesare ta baz firddo ga7i oocane› gayde gisho Qeesarego eza dakkodes qofa accida. <verse eid="ACT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26"/>Taanii E baz ta laatstse Qeesares xaafodes maaqqize erinttidebaz akkon baaya. Yinnii gisho, E baz yin bi7iko ta xaafodebaz benttod yezako ga7i yin tiino aatsii Kaati, Agirpha, ne tiino eza ki7ida. <verse eid="ACT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27"/>Akkos gayko, acinttide atstsa aatsize wode E akkos mootinttezako mikinaato ersizikaayzara ashshizanna taas eeyatitsi aazane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 25:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Agirpha tiino mahide mahe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1"/>Agripha Phawuloosago, «Neenii nebaz ohodes dandda7ane» gayda. Ye wode Phawuloosa fa kushito dentsii hyannigaara gayda:<verse eid="ACT 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2"/>«Kaati, Agripha, Ayhuduntsi tana mootide bazis ubba mahe inggodes hyayno ne tiino eqqitera taas ixa lo77o ga7i qoppane. <verse eid="ACT 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3"/>Yinnan Neenii Ayhude wogan lallen loytsii erane; yinnii gisho tana azal7ikaayzara si7ade gaar woossane.<verse eid="ACT 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4"/>«Taanii na7atitsappa aykkii ta asunts giddan Yerusalaame yezide ta yestto Ayhuduntsi ubba erane. <verse eid="ACT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5"/>Taanii tiinoppa aykkii, nu ammano higgito mintsii naagize Farisaawunts kochchappa maaqqidanno un markkidhades koyko erane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Hawa. 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Filph. 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6"/>Hyatten taanii Xoozii nu aduntsis inggoda gayde ufayssito naagize gisho mootinttii hyanne eqqida. <verse eid="ACT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7"/>Mahi taphpho lam77i nu aduntsi kochchita Xoozza qamman awaran mintsii goyniter Xoozii inggoda ga7idanno ekkodes ufayssara naagii yene. Kaati Agirpha, Ayhuduntsi tana mootizanna taanii ufayssara yinno naagize gisho. <verse eid="ACT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8"/>Xoozii hyayqqiduntsana dentsizanna akkos yin gidda ammaninttoose baz maaqqido?<verse eid="ACT 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9"/>«Zaga taanii ta ommiten Naazirete Yesuusa suntsito ixxodes dandda7inttide baz ubba oochchodes beezane ga7i qoppida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:9-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Hawa. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4-5">22:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10"/>Taanii Yerusalaame oochchidanna hyanno. Kahinunts hyalaquntsappa adetits wolqqa ekkii Xooz asuntsappa gaamuntsana accizida. Unttana wodhize woden hyayqo qofite giigida. <verse eid="ACT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11"/>Gaama wode Ayhude woosa Keetstsa ubba un seerinttode gaaran Yesuusa cazhode fana wolqqidhes qoppida. Taanii wogabaz unttana kaccii melle atto yezin, bale sa7a katama yellii unttana bay7ane.<verse eid="ACT 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12"/>«Taanii hyanna ohitis kahinunts hyalaquntsappa adetits wolqqan kiita ekkii Damasqqo qitane. <verse eid="ACT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13"/>Kaatayo, taanii awara saate oge yessadera awa foo7oppa gaama aadhize foo7o bi7ida; yinnan ta kantton taara yedhdhizunts kantto wutii saloppa foo7ida. <verse eid="ACT 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14"/>Nuunii ubbuntsi sa7ite gol7eze wode Ibraysxe doonara, ‹Saawula, Saawula, tana akkosi bay7e? Neenii nena caddize biratiza ixxiko nees wozzi iitoda› ga7i taas ohodera si7ida.<verse eid="ACT 26:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15"/>«Taanii, ‹Laatstso, ne oode?› gayda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 26:15">«Laatstsi, ‹Taanii, ne bay7ize Yesuusa; <verse eid="ACT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16"/>Yezin denddii eqqo. Hyayno neenii tana bi7idannon tiinoppa ta nena beessadanno melluntsis markkidhade gaar ta taas oochchiza mahi nena shuumodes nees benttida. <verse eid="ACT 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17"/>Isra7eele asuntsappan taanii nena unttago kiittize Ayhude maaqqoosuntsappa nena ashshoda. <verse eid="ACT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18"/>Neenii un aafto bugoda, dhumappa foo7ogo, Xalahe kusheppa Xoozago unttana mahoda. Un tana ammanii nagara atotitsi ekkoda. Xoozii ammanii geezhide asuntsi gidda fa laatto demmada› yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19"/>«Kaati Agripha, yinnii gisho, taas saloppa benttide qonccitsitis kiitinttodanno ixxikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20"/>Yezin taanii tiinidhii Damasqqo gidda yinnippa suuba Yerusalaame gidda Yihuda sa7a ubba yezuntsin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsi fa nagarappa Xoozago maaqqade gaaran nagarappa maaqqidanno beezize oocha oochchode gaar qaala ohida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:20">Hawa. 9:20</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:28-29">28-29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21"/>Yinnii gisho, Ayhuduntsi tana Xoozze Keetstsa aykkii wodhodes koyda. <verse eid="ACT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22"/>Hyayno yellodes Xoozze maade taappa shaakkinttikaaya; yinnii gisho, eeratsisin dammas markkidhitera hyanne eqqida. Nabuntsin Musen hyanoda ga7i ohidannippa melle fettibazin taanii ohidebaz baaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23"/>Yinnan, ‹Kiristtoosa madha ekkodes beezane; mahi hyayqoppa tiino denddii Ayhuduntsisin Ayhude maaqqoosuntsis foo7o awajjane› ga7i.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:20">1 Qoro. 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa. 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24"/>Phawuloosa yinno ga7i mahodera, Fisxoosa fa qaaltto dhoqi yiizii, «Phawuloosa, ne zhaashtida; ne gaama tamaaridanna nena zhaashas yeltstsida» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25"/>Yezin Phawuloosa, «Bonchcho Fisxoosa, taanii turibazin koshshize bazin ohinep attin zhaashtikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26"/>Taanii qoncce ohize ohito Kaati erane. Hyanna ohita aachichcha oochinttikaayze gisho fettin eeppa genggoosanno taanii geeshi erane.<verse eid="ACT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27"/>«Kaati Agripha, neenii nabuntsna ammanane baane? Ne ammanzanno taanii erane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 26:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28"/>Kaati Agripha, Phawuloosago, «Hyanna eerats saate tana kiristtaane mahodes koyane?» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29"/>Phawuloosa, «Gaama wode maaqqin eerats wode ne xalaala maaqqikaayzin hyayno tana si7ize ubbuntsi hyanna achitip attin ta fana maaqqade fana Xooz woossane» yagayda.<verse eid="ACT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30"/>Yinnippa suuba, Kaati Agripha gade ahize Fisxoosa, Barnniiqen unttara bettide ubbuntsi denddida. <verse eid="ACT 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31"/>Izippa kezii qititera fete fetera, «Hyay atstse hyayqos woy achchis yeltsizebaz akkon oochchikaaya» ga7i wolla ohinttida. <verse eid="ACT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32"/>Agripha Fisxoosago, «Hyay atstse ‹Qeesare ta baz firddo› gaykaayzako bilinttodes dandda7ane, yezin attida» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Roome qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1"/>Nuunii markkabera Xaaliya qitode fana un accide wode kaatuntsi kaat maaqqides wottaddaruntsana olas kiittize fete Yuuliyoosa gaaze mato hyalaqizes Phawuloosan melle eeratsi achcha yeze asuntsana inggida. <verse eid="ACT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2"/>Isiya gaxa yeze guta qitize Adiramixiyoone markkabe gidda gelii denddida. Maqedooniya asi maaqqide Teselonqe Arsxirokoosa nuura yene.<verse eid="ACT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3"/>Wonttistti wode nuunii Sidoona yellodera, Yuuliyoosa Phawuloosas loytsii fa lagguntsago hyanggi koshshize baz maadinttode gaar unttago dakkida. <verse eid="ACT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4"/>Izippa denddii tiinora nuulla baqqize gisho hyaatstsara teqinttide sa7a, Qoophiroosara kate mahi yeekka zalara aadhida. <verse eid="ACT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5"/>Kilqiyan Phinfiliya kale yeze abba fiinggi Liiqiyan yeze Muura yellida. <verse eid="ACT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6"/>Ize mato hyalaqize Xaaliya qitize Iskkinddiriya markkabe denggi, ize nuna geltsida.<verse eid="ACT 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7"/>Nuunii gaama wode leemi yedhdhii, gaama madhara Qanddoosa katama kale yellida. Yeygara qitodes nuna gote kayin Salmoonara aadhii hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a, Qarxeesara katii aadhida. <verse eid="ACT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8"/>Gaama madhara gaxa gaxa aykkii Laasiya katama kale yeze abba gaxite «Lo77o markkabe Shemppize bessi» ga7inttize besite yellida.<verse eid="ACT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9"/>Nuunii ize gaama wode gam77idannippa suuba xooma bilinttin, markkabera yedhdhizanna wayitstsize gisho Phawuloosa unttana zorida. <verse eid="ACT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10"/>«Asuntso, nu hyanggize ogite damma qohen damma dhabe yezanna taas benttane; qohita caanaallan markkabella xalaala maaqqikaayzin nu ommitillan yelloda» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11"/>Yezin mato hyalaqize Phawuloosa gaydannippa aadhii markkabe izhizayin markkabiti adayin gaazanno ammanida. <verse eid="ACT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12"/>Yinna abba gaxa yeze katama balggo agina aatsodes unttis giigoose gisho gaama asuntsi faas dandda7inttiko Finqqe katama yellii sila agina yeyga aatsodes zorinttida. Finqqe ude awa geloppan sulle awa geloppan gidda abba gaxa yeze markkabe caana ketstsize bessi sila agina ize aatstsodes qofa shiishida.<verse eid="ACT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abballa gote denddida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13"/>Eerats yeekka baqo baqqide wode un qoppidannigaara hyanide fana yi7in denddii, markkabize en7aame gaar aykkize meqiza ude ekkii Qarxeese kalera aadhida. <verse eid="ACT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14"/>Yezin gaama gam77ikaayzin «Awuraqiis» gaaze damma gote hyaatsara teqinttide sa7itippa sulle unttalla afa denddida. <verse eid="ACT 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15"/>Ye gotize markkabiza urqqii hyanggaame fana kayde gisho baqize markkabiza fa koyde bessa kanggode fana dakkii ashshida.<verse eid="ACT 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16"/>Nuunii Qeeda gaaze hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a katii hyanggitera gaama waayera markkabize gonggiza ashshodes dandda7ida. <verse eid="ACT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17"/>Un gonggiza ude kessidannippa suuba gaadera markkabizella xaaxii, mintsii accida. Surtiisa gaaze shaftte fana gol7izaame gaar yirggii, markkabize shartto ketstsii markkabiza hyarii izhida.<verse eid="ACT 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18"/>Gotize miinggi hyanggodera wonttisti wode caanttippa baggito Abba ole aykkida. <verse eid="ACT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19"/>Hyaydzdzintsa qamma markkabize miishito ekkii fa kushtira olida. <verse eid="ACT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20"/>Nuunii gaama wode awa aafen xoolintton bi7ikaayze gishon damma gote nuulla baqqide gisho tiinoppa shemppora attoda ga7i qoppikaaya.<verse eid="ACT 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21"/>Ye wode un gaama wode katstsa miikaayzara gam77ide gisho Phawuloosa un gidda denddii eqqii, «Asuntso, yin ta zortto ekkii Qarxeesappa denddikaayzara attezako hyanna qohitan dhabitan nuna yellaama yeshsha. <verse eid="ACT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22"/>Yezin taanii yinttana zhashtippete ga7i zorane; akkos gayko, hyay markkabize dhabodap attin yinttappa fettii as shemppon dhaboos. <verse eid="ACT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23"/>Hyayno qamma ta E baz maaqqidayin ta goynize Xoozze kiittide kiitanchcho ta kale eqqii, <verse eid="ACT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24"/>‹Phawuloosa, zhashtippe; neenii Roome Kaati Qeesare tiino eqqodes beezane. Yikke Xoozii ne gisho neera hyanggize asunts ubbunts shemppito ashshida› gayda. <verse eid="ACT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25"/>Yinnii gisho, asuntso, zhashtippete. Ye kiitanchchize taas ohidanna hyanodanno ta Xoozza ammanane. <verse eid="ACT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26"/>Yezin baqize nuna kanggi fettii hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a gaxa oloda» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27"/>Taphpho oydintsa qamma Adiriya Abba gidda nuna baqita goden hyankan urqqodera, qamma giddii bilahe maaqqize wode markkabite oochchizuntsis sa7ago ukkide gaar aazida. <verse eid="ACT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28"/>Un geennatitsito erodes koyi gaade bertstsa deexobaz accii Abba olin, abba gentta osfun tam hyadha maaqqida. Eeratsi gam77i, mahi olin izippun tam hyadha maaqqida. <verse eid="ACT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29"/>Un abba gaxa yeze shuchchalla dom7inttaame gaar zhashtii, markkabize qitaame gaar aykkize oyddii meqo markkabizeppa suubara abba dakkii, sa7ita wonttode gaar Xooz woossida. <verse eid="ACT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30"/>Markkabite oochchizuntsi markkabizeppa dhabodes koyi, markkabize qitaame gaar aykkize meqito markkabizeppa tiino zalara abba olize gaar aazizi gonggiza abba olida. <verse eid="ACT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31"/>Phawuloosa mato hyalaqizegon wottaddaruntsago, «Hyantses markkabite shemppii bettanxiko yin attodes dandda7oos» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 27:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32"/>Yinnii gisho, wottaddaruntsi gonggize acinttide gaadiza gachchii dakkii ashshida.<verse eid="ACT 27:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33"/>Sa7a wonttodes yi7adera ubbuntsi katstsa ma7ade gaar Phawuloosa asuntsago, «Yin katstsa mu7ikaayzara gam7ide hyaynora taphpho oyddii qamma gam7ida. <verse eid="ACT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34"/>Yinnii gisho, eeratsi katstsa yin ma7ade gaar taanii yinttana woossane. Yin minggode gaaran shemppora yessade gaar eeratsi katstsa ma7ades koshshane; melle atto yezin yin omma isintsitip fettin dhaboos» gayda. <verse eid="ACT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35"/>Phawuloosa yinno ga7i boora ekkii ubbunts tiino Xooz galatida; booriza baxxi me7e aykkida. <verse eid="ACT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36"/>Ubbuntsi miinggi fa faas katstsa ekkii mu7ida. <verse eid="ACT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37"/>Nuunii markkabite yezuntsi lam77i xeeti laappun tam izippun. <verse eid="ACT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38"/>Un mu7i mizhide wode caana zargito abba olin markkabize deexito foollizida.<verse eid="ACT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Markkabize meqqida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39"/>Sa7a wonttide wode markkabe oochchizunntsi aba sa7a yellezako erikaayzara, abba gaxa yeze shafe silimo bi7ida. Faas dandda7inttiko markkabiza yinna shafttigo shiishodes qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40"/>Yeyzi, markkabize qitaame gaar aykkize meqito billii Abba olida. Ye wode izhize minxa accize gaadiza billida. Yinnippa suuba, baqita markkabiza tiino urqqode gaar markkabiza kanggize shara tiino zalara dhoqi yiizii yedhdhe aykkida. <verse eid="ACT 27:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41"/>Yezin markkabize shafe nadinttidella dom7inttii qoodhinttida. Markkabizes tiino zaltta xosinttii shaftto caddii aykkii en7anxi ixxin, suuba zaltto gote urqqizannippa denddii meqqe aykkida.<verse eid="ACT 27:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42"/>Wottaddaruntsi achi asuntsappa fettin hyaatsite hyadhdhii kezii dhabaame gaar unttana wodhodes zorinttida. <verse eid="ACT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43"/>Yezin mato hyalaqize Phawuloosa ashshodes koyi wottaddaruntsara zorintto ixxida. Hyaatsi hyadhdhii erize ubba markkabizeppa hyaatsite doollii doollii wodhdhii tiinidhdhii gaxa kessade gaar kiittida. <verse eid="ACT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44"/>Attiduntsi sanqqitillan, markkabize meqitsitilla afa kessade gaar kiittida. Yinnii gaara yi7i ubbuntsi gaxa sarora kezida.<verse eid="ACT 27:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Maltta hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1"/>Nuunii gaxa sarora kezide wode yellidanna hyaatsara teqinttide sa7ita Maltta ga7inttizanno erida. <verse eid="ACT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2"/>Maltta asuntsi nuus gaama lo77ida. Ira bukkide gishon ciishize gisho tama eetsii nuna ubba mokkida. <verse eid="ACT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3"/>Phawuloosa gaama hyayxe shiishii tama gaddodera, goppi michiti gisho kezii E kushtilla xaaxintti eza dhayda. <verse eid="ACT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4"/>Maltta asuntsi goppi Phawuloosa kushite xaaxinttidanno bi7ide wode fetay fetego, «Turo hyay atstse shemppo wodhide asi; melle atto yezin abbappa E attinin xoozze firddappa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Xoozze firddappa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye wode yinna sa7ite melle melle maachi xoozuntsi yene. Unttappa fetta iita oochchize asuntsana firddizanno. Iza firdda xoozii ga7intti xeeginttida.</char></note> attii faxa yessades dandda7ikaaya» yagayda. <verse eid="ACT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5"/>Yezin Phawuloosa fa kushtippa shooshiza wuxurkki, tama olida; eza akkon qohikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6"/>Un, «E galtta kixxane, woy tiirikaayzin gol7i hyayqqane» ga7i naagane. Yezin gaama wode naagii E gallite akkon dummudhide baz dhabin, «Hyay eeqa» ga7i fa qoftto laammida. <verse eid="ACT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7"/>Yinna kara ganccite hyaatsara teqinttide sa7a hyalaqize, Pupliyoosa gaazes gade yene; hyaydzdzii qamma yellodes E nuna siiqora mokkida. <verse eid="ACT 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8"/>Pupliyoosa aday omma otstsi, micharan gancce hyarggera woy7i yene. Phawuloosa E kara gelii ees Xooz woossida; fa kushito eella gaddii fatstsida. <verse eid="ACT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9"/>Yinnippa suuba, Malttan yeze hyargginttize melle asuntsin yi7i faxida. <verse eid="ACT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10"/>Un nuna gaama bonchchida; nuunii markkabera qitodes denddide wode oges koshshize baz nuus inggidda.<verse eid="ACT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Malttappa Roome qitida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11"/>Hyaydzdzii aginappa suuba, Maltta gidda seete aatsii Iskkinddiriya markkabera hyammades denddida. Ye markkabizella Diyosqoroosa gaaze mentte eequntsi misile yene. <verse eid="ACT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12"/>Sirakuuse katama gelii ize hyaydzdzii qamma bettida. <verse eid="ACT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13"/>Izippa denddii Regiyume katama yellida. Fettii qammappa suuba, yeekka zalara baqo baqqin, wonttisti wode Futiyulosa katama yi7ida. <verse eid="ACT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14"/>Ize nu fettii fettii ammanze asuntsana denggin, faara saamintta gam77ode gaar nuna woossida. Yinnippa suuba, Roome nu qitida.<verse eid="ACT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15"/>Roome yeze ammanze asuntsi nu baz si7i, Afiyoosa Gabe, Hyaydzdzii Aqize bessi ga7inttize bessito yellodes nuna mokkodes yi7ida. Phawuloosa unttana bi7ide wode Xooz galatii minggida.<verse eid="ACT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa Roome gidda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16"/>Nu Roome gelide wode Phawuloosa naagize wottaddare ingginttin faas yezo ga7inttida.<verse eid="ACT 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17"/>Hyaydzdzii qammappa suuba, Phawuloosa Ayhudunts hyalaquntsana faago xeegizida. Un shiiqide wode unttago, «Ta ishuntso, taanii nu asuntsana woy nu aduntsi wogalla akko qohize bazin oochchikaaya, yezin tana Yerusalaame accii Roome asuntsis aatsii inggidda. <verse eid="ACT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18"/>Un ta mootto bi7i hyayqos yeltsizebaz taalla akko bazin denggikaayze gisho tana billodes qoppida. <verse eid="ACT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19"/>Yezin Ayhuduntsi yinno ixxide wode un7intti ‹Ta baz Qeesare firddo› gaydap attin taanii ta worzhito mootizebaz yezin baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">Hawa. 25:11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ACT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20"/>Ta yinttana xeegizidanna yinttana be7adesin yinttis hyanno ohodes. Ta hyanna santsalaatar acinttidanna Isra7eele asuntsi naagize ufayssiti gisho» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21"/>Ayhude hyalaquntsi Phawuloosago, «Nuus Yihudappa nebaz dabddaabbe yellikaaya. Izippa ye7eze asuntsappa fettin nebaz iita ohize baaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22"/>Yezin hyanna ne kaallize ammantto melle melle besite asuntsi ixxizanno nuunii erize gisho ne qoftto si7odes koyane» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23"/>Un fa ye7ode qammito Phawuloosas qaxarii, yinna qammite gaanggi E yeze besite yi7ida. E wonttappa ugure yellodes Xoozze ka7itumo baz unttis markkidhida. Mahi un Yesuusa baz ammanode gaar Muse higgefan nabunts maxaafeppa geeshi unttana tamaarssida. <verse eid="ACT 28:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24"/>Fete fete Phawuloosa gaydanno ammanida, yezin melluntsi ammanikaaya. <verse eid="ACT 28:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25"/>Un wol gidda ohito ekkanxide wode Phawuloosa fettibaz gaydannippa suuba qitida. E hyannigaara gayda: «Geeshi Ayyaana yin aduntsis nabe Isayaasa doontte ohidanna turo.<verse eid="ACT 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26"/>«Neenii yentsi asuntsago hyanggi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">yin sissi si7ine, yezin yin qoppoos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:26">yin be7e be7ine, yezin denggoos.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Isa. 6:9-10</ref></char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27"/>Hyantsi asunts wozintta muumida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">un hyayta tullida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">un aaftan goozinttida.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">Yinna baayzako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">un fa aafte bi7i, fa hyayte si7i, fa wozintte tiirii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">un taago maaqqiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">taanin unttana fatstsod yeshsha ga7o» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28"/>«Yikke, hyanna Xoozze ashshize kiita Ayhude maaqqoosuntsis maaqqidanno erane. Unttin si7oda» gayda.<verse eid="ACT 28:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29"/>Phawuloosa yinno ga7idannippa suuba Ayhuduntsi fa gidda gaama lallite kezii qitida<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zaga fettii fettii kushera xaafinttide maxaafite faydo 29 baaya.</char></note>.<verse eid="ACT 28:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30"/>Phawuloosa kira keetstsa lam77i bere kumutsi yezida; ize yezitera faago yi7iza ubba mokkane. <verse eid="ACT 28:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31"/>Zhashimo baytsi ooden kaykaayzin Xoozze ka7itumo sabbakida; Laatstse Yesuus Kiristtoosa baz qonccizi tamaarssida.<verse eid="ACT 28:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28"/>
</usx>
